(4572557, 659061, 656, '<td valign="top">it seems incredibly niggly to complain about on such a lovely portrait, but that tree branch breaking up the lines of the tower seems to pull me out of the flow around the image. I might have light to have some space around their shadows to move around too.  He tends to get lost against the door frame too - lots of merges throughout the frame.  Lovely light.</td>', 'it seems incredibly niggly to complain about on such a lovely portrait, but that tree branch breaking up the lines of the tower seems to pull me out of the flow around the image. I might have light to have some space around their shadows to move around too.  He tends to get lost against the door frame too - lots of merges throughout the frame.  Lovely light.', '2008-03-19 00:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
