(4573195, 659257, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great composition and framing. Focus seems to be on bracelet more than the eyes. When I see this he doesn''t look like a real carpenter. He looks like a young, hip dude who happened to pick up a hammer in a construction environment. I can''t tell if that''s good or bad. Black and white works well, only issue is focus.</td>', 'Great composition and framing. Focus seems to be on bracelet more than the eyes. When I see this he doesn''t look like a real carpenter. He looks like a young, hip dude who happened to pick up a hammer in a construction environment. I can''t tell if that''s good or bad. Black and white works well, only issue is focus.', '2008-03-19 06:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573198, 659063, 88204, '<td valign="top">How the heck did you get this with the airplane reflected in the glasses?! I love it! It feels like the blacks could be a little blacker... maybe pump up the contrast very slightly. Great shot. Is he REALLY a pilot? He looks a little shaggy for a pilot.  :)</td>', 'How the heck did you get this with the airplane reflected in the glasses?! I love it! It feels like the blacks could be a little blacker... maybe pump up the contrast very slightly. Great shot. Is he REALLY a pilot? He looks a little shaggy for a pilot.  :)', '2008-03-19 06:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
