(4573834, 657504, 61958, '<td valign="top">I think being in colour would have given the garbage a better chance of speaking for itself. without the title I would not have known what it was.</td>', 'I think being in colour would have given the garbage a better chance of speaking for itself. without the title I would not have known what it was.', '2008-03-19 11:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573836, 659182, 61958, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen more of the face... toherwise great shot</td>', 'I would like to have seen more of the face... toherwise great shot', '2008-03-19 11:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573839, 658826, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait but I see no environment...</td>', 'Nice portrait but I see no environment...', '2008-03-19 11:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573842, 659243, 86799, '<td valign="top">Good portrait, but looks pretty oversharpened and overcontrasted.  Might look less harsh if you turn it down a notch.</td>', 'Good portrait, but looks pretty oversharpened and overcontrasted.  Might look less harsh if you turn it down a notch.', '2008-03-19 11:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573843, 659588, 61958, '<td valign="top">this has a very snapshotish feel to it, as well I''m guessing you used the onboard flash which has created some harsh shadows. composition is slightly on the boring side as well with w kick boxer it might have been interesting to have a much more dramitc angle and pose for the photo.</td>', 'this has a very snapshotish feel to it, as well I''m guessing you used the onboard flash which has created some harsh shadows. composition is slightly on the boring side as well with w kick boxer it might have been interesting to have a much more dramitc angle and pose for the photo.', '2008-03-19 11:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573845, 659688, 61958, '<td valign="top">would have also liked to see some water underneath aswell</td>', 'would have also liked to see some water underneath aswell', '2008-03-19 12:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573849, 659677, 61958, '<td valign="top">nice and very environmental :) WB is a bit off though</td>', 'nice and very environmental :) WB is a bit off though', '2008-03-19 12:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573852, 658954, 58691, '<td valign="top">Well done. Panning is good and the sharpness is decent. I''m not sure I would consider this an eviron. portrait as the subject does not seem aware or engaged in the shot, which is my definition of a portrait.</td>', 'Well done. Panning is good and the sharpness is decent. I''m not sure I would consider this an eviron. portrait as the subject does not seem aware or engaged in the shot, which is my definition of a portrait.', '2008-03-19 12:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573854, 659203, 61958, '<td valign="top">great shot. i like that the BG is very neat and orderly as you would emigin it.</td>', 'great shot. i like that the BG is very neat and orderly as you would emigin it.', '2008-03-19 12:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573855, 659383, 61958, '<td valign="top">very nice portrait however there is not enough of the environment for this to fit for me</td>', 'very nice portrait however there is not enough of the environment for this to fit for me', '2008-03-19 12:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573856, 658983, 61958, '<td valign="top">this feels more like a snapshot than a portrait.</td>', 'this feels more like a snapshot than a portrait.', '2008-03-19 12:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
