(4573887, 659189, 58691, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and result of this image. The choice of black clothing for the assistant was a good compliment to the blown-out left side of the image.</td>', 'I like the composition and result of this image. The choice of black clothing for the assistant was a good compliment to the blown-out left side of the image.', '2008-03-19 12:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
