(4573960, 659235, 58691, '<td valign="top">Focus is rather soft and lighting a bit harsh. I like the "why are you taking my picture" expression on the subject''s face.</td>', 'Focus is rather soft and lighting a bit harsh. I like the "why are you taking my picture" expression on the subject''s face.', '2008-03-19 12:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
