(4573974, 658558, 84124, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Interesting use of color.  You definitely met the challenge criteria, but I needed to be helped by the title.  I like the tight cropping.</td>', 'Wow.  Interesting use of color.  You definitely met the challenge criteria, but I needed to be helped by the title.  I like the tight cropping.', '2008-03-19 12:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
