(4574064, 657575, 84124, '<td valign="top">The intensity in this photo helps it out a ton.  You can almost sense "hurry up, take the shot, we need to get back to work".  You did a great job conveying that.</td>', 'The intensity in this photo helps it out a ton.  You can almost sense "hurry up, take the shot, we need to get back to work".  You did a great job conveying that.', '2008-03-19 12:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
