(4574082, 658671, 84124, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, but a wider field would have helped this shot.  His face tells a story, but I want the environment to tell a story as well.</td>', 'Great portrait, but a wider field would have helped this shot.  His face tells a story, but I want the environment to tell a story as well.', '2008-03-19 12:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
