(4574478, 659690, 19708, '<td valign="top">The minor CCW tilt on this is a bit uneasy. More angle to be artistic or none at all would have been better in my opinion. Regarding their environment, well structure usually are around them, but some railings, ramps or similar would help.</td>', 'The minor CCW tilt on this is a bit uneasy. More angle to be artistic or none at all would have been better in my opinion. Regarding their environment, well structure usually are around them, but some railings, ramps or similar would help.', '2008-03-19 15:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
