(4574511, 658826, 79021, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and processing.  Although this is a portrait, it doesn''t show the her environment...4</td>', 'Nice shot and processing.  Although this is a portrait, it doesn''t show the her environment...4', '2008-03-19 15:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574512, 659101, 79021, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I think the processing (sepia tones or whatever you used) is well done.  however, the side of the dogs face is blacked out and it looks like she''s missing an eye, at least on my monitor (calibrated with spyder 2)...4</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I think the processing (sepia tones or whatever you used) is well done.  however, the side of the dogs face is blacked out and it looks like she''s missing an eye, at least on my monitor (calibrated with spyder 2)...4', '2008-03-19 15:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574522, 659461, 79021, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait.  The lighting on the left (his right) is well done although it does make it look like his jacket has two tones.  His reflection in the top right is important for separating this from being just a picture of a guy at a piano.  I don''t quite understand how his reflection is being made, but that is probably a lack of knowledge about pianos on my part....7 nonetheless</td>', 'Interesting portrait.  The lighting on the left (his right) is well done although it does make it look like his jacket has two tones.  His reflection in the top right is important for separating this from being just a picture of a guy at a piano.  I don''t quite understand how his reflection is being made, but that is probably a lack of knowledge about pianos on my part....7 nonetheless', '2008-03-19 15:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574529, 659063, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent, completely original capture.  Well done.  The reflection in the glasses worked perfectly.  To nitpick, I would have preferred for the left part of the hat not to have been cropped.  Also, the black and white conversion is a bit flat, at least on my monitor.  Maybe some curves or a touch of contrast could help that.  Either way, this still gets a 9 for me...hopefully a ribbon</td>', 'This is an excellent, completely original capture.  Well done.  The reflection in the glasses worked perfectly.  To nitpick, I would have preferred for the left part of the hat not to have been cropped.  Also, the black and white conversion is a bit flat, at least on my monitor.  Maybe some curves or a touch of contrast could help that.  Either way, this still gets a 9 for me...hopefully a ribbon', '2008-03-19 15:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574541, 659588, 79021, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit off, or maybe it is the white balance.  I would have liked to have seen more of her, maybe zoom out a little so that the heavy bag is more visible.  The cropping makes her look rather short as well...4</td>', 'The lighting is a bit off, or maybe it is the white balance.  I would have liked to have seen more of her, maybe zoom out a little so that the heavy bag is more visible.  The cropping makes her look rather short as well...4', '2008-03-19 15:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574543, 659192, 79021, '<td valign="top">Very noisy, very pixelated.  Your flash caused his eyes to glow and there appears to be a fair amount of CA, mostly purple fringing from what I see...1</td>', 'Very noisy, very pixelated.  Your flash caused his eyes to glow and there appears to be a fair amount of CA, mostly purple fringing from what I see...1', '2008-03-19 15:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
