(4574557, 659344, 79021, '<td valign="top">The picture and title work very well together.  The background with Ali adds significantly to this picture and the overall shot is very well composed.  What I find distracting is the black and white cutoff shirt.  Boxing photos such as this are typically done in just the trunks and gloves, although I guess amateurs wear jerseys...you get an 8 from me, hopefully top ten for composition and orginiality</td>', 'The picture and title work very well together.  The background with Ali adds significantly to this picture and the overall shot is very well composed.  What I find distracting is the black and white cutoff shirt.  Boxing photos such as this are typically done in just the trunks and gloves, although I guess amateurs wear jerseys...you get an 8 from me, hopefully top ten for composition and orginiality', '2008-03-19 15:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
