(4574937, 659152, 90658, '<td valign="top">Not sure why this seems off to me.  Composition seems good, coloring seems good, focus could be a weensy bit better, but not off enough to be obvious.  I think that what happened here is that the arch in the back suggests framing that could not be achieved with live people doing their thing.  It''s not like they would pose for a general person with a camera.</td>', 'Not sure why this seems off to me.  Composition seems good, coloring seems good, focus could be a weensy bit better, but not off enough to be obvious.  I think that what happened here is that the arch in the back suggests framing that could not be achieved with live people doing their thing.  It''s not like they would pose for a general person with a camera.', '2008-03-19 17:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
