(4574964, 659171, 58691, '<td valign="top">Composition and exposure are excellent. Going grayscale with it seems to sap the life out of the image, though.</td>', 'Composition and exposure are excellent. Going grayscale with it seems to sap the life out of the image, though.', '2008-03-19 17:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574966, 658829, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the story here.  One question, how is it that this teen''s room is clean?  I have a pre-teen that lives in a constant state of "explosion."</td>', 'I like the story here.  One question, how is it that this teen''s room is clean?  I have a pre-teen that lives in a constant state of "explosion."', '2008-03-19 17:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574967, 658609, 34255, '<td valign="top">This would be more engaging as a portrait if you were closer to the subject.</td>', 'This would be more engaging as a portrait if you were closer to the subject.', '2008-03-19 17:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574968, 658493, 79021, '<td valign="top">I actually really enjoy this picture.  The black and white conversion is well done and I like how the background gets blown out in the middle, I think it makes for a more dramatic shot.  The horizon is tilted, however, which seems odd since she appears to be standing straight up.  I fail to see how this really fits the title and the challenge as a whole.  She is alone, but I don''t see how her environment says anything about her.  Challenge aside, this should put in a nice frame and on your wall.  In a free study I probably would have given this a 7, for the challenge I give it a 5 though...5</td>', 'I actually really enjoy this picture.  The black and white conversion is well done and I like how the background gets blown out in the middle, I think it makes for a more dramatic shot.  The horizon is tilted, however, which seems odd since she appears to be standing straight up.  I fail to see how this really fits the title and the challenge as a whole.  She is alone, but I don''t see how her environment says anything about her.  Challenge aside, this should put in a nice frame and on your wall.  In a free study I probably would have given this a 7, for the challenge I give it a 5 though...5', '2008-03-19 17:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574970, 658303, 58691, '<td valign="top">Wow, I wish I knew what freaky human experiment was going on here. Well done!</td>', 'Wow, I wish I knew what freaky human experiment was going on here. Well done!', '2008-03-19 17:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574971, 658684, 34255, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the noise; I don''t know if that was intentional or not.</td>', 'I really don''t like the noise; I don''t know if that was intentional or not.', '2008-03-19 18:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574972, 658886, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Were there any other swimmers in the pool?  This is one of those times when a wider shot might OR might NOT be better.  Hard to imagine what others in the frame would add.</td>', 'Well done.  Were there any other swimmers in the pool?  This is one of those times when a wider shot might OR might NOT be better.  Hard to imagine what others in the frame would add.', '2008-03-19 18:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574973, 659047, 79021, '<td valign="top">Lighting is not very flattering and I would have liked to have seen more of the book to go along with the title.  Good choice tilting the glasses downward to avoid reflection though...5</td>', 'Lighting is not very flattering and I would have liked to have seen more of the book to go along with the title.  Good choice tilting the glasses downward to avoid reflection though...5', '2008-03-19 18:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
