(4574977, 658968, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time sensing the focal point here.  It seems like the thumb on the wine bottle is the only thing sharply defined here.  Could be my eyes, so I wouldn''t take it as anything other than an observation.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time sensing the focal point here.  It seems like the thumb on the wine bottle is the only thing sharply defined here.  Could be my eyes, so I wouldn''t take it as anything other than an observation.', '2008-03-19 18:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574980, 659060, 77521, '<td valign="top">i can see this ribboning. everything about this shot is perfect, focus, everything. sure he isn''t who i am voting for but i can''t vote you down for that. :] 10</td>', 'i can see this ribboning. everything about this shot is perfect, focus, everything. sure he isn''t who i am voting for but i can''t vote you down for that. :] 10', '2008-03-19 18:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574981, 659383, 79021, '<td valign="top">Strong portrait and composition.  The sharpening is nicely done, along with the rest of the processing.  The lighting is also very well done and adds a dramatic feel to the shot.  My only problem with rating this is that the makeup or dirt on the face and the hat are really what connects with the title, rather than the environment as the challenge suggested.  Therefore, I give this a 6</td>', 'Strong portrait and composition.  The sharpening is nicely done, along with the rest of the processing.  The lighting is also very well done and adds a dramatic feel to the shot.  My only problem with rating this is that the makeup or dirt on the face and the hat are really what connects with the title, rather than the environment as the challenge suggested.  Therefore, I give this a 6', '2008-03-19 18:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574983, 659171, 79021, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and having the kids blurred.  The bulletin board is also a nice touch as well.  The black and white conversion works, but I''m guessing that the bulletin board is brightly colored and would have probably made the shot that much more interesting...5</td>', 'Very nice idea and having the kids blurred.  The bulletin board is also a nice touch as well.  The black and white conversion works, but I''m guessing that the bulletin board is brightly colored and would have probably made the shot that much more interesting...5', '2008-03-19 18:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574986, 659632, 79021, '<td valign="top">Arm and face and almost completely blown out and I''m not quite sure what he is doing here in his "environment."  Either the lighting was harsh or you bumped up the contrast way too much...3</td>', 'Arm and face and almost completely blown out and I''m not quite sure what he is doing here in his "environment."  Either the lighting was harsh or you bumped up the contrast way too much...3', '2008-03-19 18:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
