(4574990, 658474, 90658, '<td valign="top">Other than a disdainful evil look, dark shading and a hoody, how does this picture communicate a criminal?  He could just be angry or frustrated or generally any other antisocial teen filled with angst.  The environment is what is missing here.  Imagine this face in an urban environment surrounded by other such faces, then you would have communicated "the criminal element."  However, that being said, this shot does have something tantalizing and hypnotic in it.</td>', 'Other than a disdainful evil look, dark shading and a hoody, how does this picture communicate a criminal?  He could just be angry or frustrated or generally any other antisocial teen filled with angst.  The environment is what is missing here.  Imagine this face in an urban environment surrounded by other such faces, then you would have communicated "the criminal element."  However, that being said, this shot does have something tantalizing and hypnotic in it.', '2008-03-19 18:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574991, 658555, 34255, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  This would have more impact as a portrait if he were facing you.</td>', 'Nice concept.  This would have more impact as a portrait if he were facing you.', '2008-03-19 18:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574993, 659361, 79021, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Looks like a wide angle or fisheye lens which gives a distorted view of Frankies face, but in a good way.  The lighting on the left side is very well done as are the out of focus areas.  The pain on the shirt and the roller are a nice touch against the painted (or soon to be painted) wall...7</td>', 'Very well done.  Looks like a wide angle or fisheye lens which gives a distorted view of Frankies face, but in a good way.  The lighting on the left side is very well done as are the out of focus areas.  The pain on the shirt and the roller are a nice touch against the painted (or soon to be painted) wall...7', '2008-03-19 18:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
