(4575963, 659310, 70689, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty good way of portraying a farmer, I like it. Would have been even better if the front of the farmer had been given a little more light. This is one of the rare instances where an on board flash might actually be useful.</td>', 'That''s a pretty good way of portraying a farmer, I like it. Would have been even better if the front of the farmer had been given a little more light. This is one of the rare instances where an on board flash might actually be useful.', '2008-03-20 06:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575967, 658091, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh, I like this one. Background is a tad to busy, IMO. Like the colors and the sharpness. His expression is so lovely! Nice shot!</td>', 'oh, I like this one. Background is a tad to busy, IMO. Like the colors and the sharpness. His expression is so lovely! Nice shot!', '2008-03-20 06:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575968, 657707, 70689, '<td valign="top">hmmm, yes, it is a portrait and it is taken in its environment. And yes, the title explains the environment. But still, this is not the environment I would like to see a lion in. It is a nice pic though, maybe a little more context or surroundings -while keeping the lion out of the center of the picture, would have made it even nicer.</td>', 'hmmm, yes, it is a portrait and it is taken in its environment. And yes, the title explains the environment. But still, this is not the environment I would like to see a lion in. It is a nice pic though, maybe a little more context or surroundings -while keeping the lion out of the center of the picture, would have made it even nicer.', '2008-03-20 06:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575970, 658972, 70689, '<td valign="top">Very good picture. I like the composition and the contrast and colors. Very effective use of DOF to make the guy stand out.</td>', 'Very good picture. I like the composition and the contrast and colors. Very effective use of DOF to make the guy stand out.', '2008-03-20 06:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575972, 658609, 69368, '<td valign="top">it would be great, to see his face</td>', 'it would be great, to see his face', '2008-03-20 06:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575975, 657504, 69368, '<td valign="top">the b+w works very well.</td>', 'the b+w works very well.', '2008-03-20 06:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575976, 658557, 70689, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. I can relate to this angle with the blue sky, and that would make the title fit wel, but I don''t realy get the connection. What''s more important, I think the face could use more light. A fill flash or maybe some kind of relection of available light would have made this a much better portrait.</td>', 'I don''t get it. I can relate to this angle with the blue sky, and that would make the title fit wel, but I don''t realy get the connection. What''s more important, I think the face could use more light. A fill flash or maybe some kind of relection of available light would have made this a much better portrait.', '2008-03-20 06:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575978, 658303, 69368, '<td valign="top">Can''t say why, but this mademe smile ;-)<br/>Well done!</td>', 'Can''t say why, but this mademe smile ;-)Well done!', '2008-03-20 06:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575980, 658985, 70689, '<td valign="top">You made me smile. Very good concept and so familiar. Well composed and nicely lit. Some motion blur outside the window to suggest speed would have been a great bonus, but I can think of a dozen reasons why not to.</td>', 'You made me smile. Very good concept and so familiar. Well composed and nicely lit. Some motion blur outside the window to suggest speed would have been a great bonus, but I can think of a dozen reasons why not to.', '2008-03-20 06:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575983, 659243, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice. Realy a classic env portrait imo. A tad oversharpened for my taste though.</td>', 'Nice. Realy a classic env portrait imo. A tad oversharpened for my taste though.', '2008-03-20 06:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575984, 659391, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh, wow. there are so many details. Have to look around for some minutes. And I have to smile about !</td>', 'oh, wow. there are so many details. Have to look around for some minutes. And I have to smile about !', '2008-03-20 06:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575986, 659383, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great pic, very subtle black on black, great lighting and facial expression. I would have liked a little more environment though, this might as well be a studio shot.</td>', 'Great pic, very subtle black on black, great lighting and facial expression. I would have liked a little more environment though, this might as well be a studio shot.', '2008-03-20 06:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575988, 659061, 70689, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great pic of the chapel, but what are these people doing in front of it?<br/> <br/>Seriously, if you put this amount of environment around a portrait, make sure that ligthing, composition or both lead the eye of the viewer to your main subject. Having the couple lit with a remote strobe (2 maybe?) for instance might have helped.</td>', 'I think this is a great pic of the chapel, but what are these people doing in front of it? Seriously, if you put this amount of environment around a portrait, make sure that ligthing, composition or both lead the eye of the viewer to your main subject. Having the couple lit with a remote strobe (2 maybe?) for instance might have helped.', '2008-03-20 06:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575990, 659047, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and very good lighting. Besides, I have the hots for intellectual women. But I get the strong impression that the focus is on the galsses rather than the eyes.</td>', 'Nice concept and very good lighting. Besides, I have the hots for intellectual women. But I get the strong impression that the focus is on the galsses rather than the eyes.', '2008-03-20 06:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575993, 658986, 49109, '<td valign="top">more a tourist snapshot than an environmental portrait; light is quite flat, arm and backpack are cropped, his expression doesn''t tell anything</td>', 'more a tourist snapshot than an environmental portrait; light is quite flat, arm and backpack are cropped, his expression doesn''t tell anything', '2008-03-20 06:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575994, 659383, 13829, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, excellent lighting and I really like the black background and the black shirt. But where is his environment? I would love to see where/how he works. I am sorry, but a safety hat and some dust on his face does not tell me enouhg about him.</td>', 'Lovely portrait, excellent lighting and I really like the black background and the black shirt. But where is his environment? I would love to see where/how he works. I am sorry, but a safety hat and some dust on his face does not tell me enouhg about him.', '2008-03-20 06:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575995, 658964, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice vacvation shot except for the slightly tilted horizon. not a portrait at all</td>', 'nice vacvation shot except for the slightly tilted horizon. not a portrait at all', '2008-03-20 06:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575996, 659666, 70689, '<td valign="top">This pic has some very strong elements, such as lighting, composition, pose and facial expression. It fits the challenge very well too, and it might score well or even very well. I am put off by post processing though. To me, this looks like a paintbrushed image rather than a photograph. I am not sure what you did and whether it is legal in basic. Bottom line is I think you did too much of it and ruined a great picture.</td>', 'This pic has some very strong elements, such as lighting, composition, pose and facial expression. It fits the challenge very well too, and it might score well or even very well. I am put off by post processing though. To me, this looks like a paintbrushed image rather than a photograph. I am not sure what you did and whether it is legal in basic. Bottom line is I think you did too much of it and ruined a great picture.', '2008-03-20 06:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575997, 659394, 79141, '<td valign="top">nice  use of  angles</td>', 'nice  use of  angles', '2008-03-20 06:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
