(4576012, 659210, 13829, '<td valign="top">This is one of my faves on this challenge. IMO B/W works really well with your subject. I''ve got the feel that this was a setup, but it really doesn''t matter to me because it also feels an authentic representation.<br/>The serious expression on his face is priceless :)<br/>Congrats and good luck!</td>', 'This is one of my faves on this challenge. IMO B/W works really well with your subject. I''ve got the feel that this was a setup, but it really doesn''t matter to me because it also feels an authentic representation.The serious expression on his face is priceless :)Congrats and good luck!', '2008-03-20 07:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
