(4576033, 659461, 70689, '<td valign="top">This is a pic that made me sit closer to my screen and study it. I like the composition, inclusidng the reflections. Having the piano open and seeing the snares out of focus is nice too. You did a nice job on b/w conversion as well. It is too bad though that the guy looks so bored.</td>', 'This is a pic that made me sit closer to my screen and study it. I like the composition, inclusidng the reflections. Having the piano open and seeing the snares out of focus is nice too. You did a nice job on b/w conversion as well. It is too bad though that the guy looks so bored.', '2008-03-20 07:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4576034, 659470, 79141, '<td valign="top">the  horizontal slant is a  bit off putting</td>', 'the  horizontal slant is a  bit off putting', '2008-03-20 07:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
