(4577292, 657504, 89219, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail and lighting on the subject but I think this would have been a better shot for the challenge if you had a higher depth of field.  I do like the grain in the background but if it weren''t for the title I may not worked out where he was.</td>', 'I really like the detail and lighting on the subject but I think this would have been a better shot for the challenge if you had a higher depth of field.  I do like the grain in the background but if it weren''t for the title I may not worked out where he was.', '2008-03-20 15:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4577319, 659666, 89219, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is maybe all the hair but this it almost like he was drawn.  Even the texture of his shirt seems unusual.  <br/> <br/>Dont get me wrong I think this is a good thing and makes it an interesting shot, I''d be interested to know how you achieved this.  I kinda wish you''d dusted that lamp though....probably just the clean freak in me speaking out. And the title bugs me as its well lit and doesn''t have the feel of a late night.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is maybe all the hair but this it almost like he was drawn.  Even the texture of his shirt seems unusual.   Dont get me wrong I think this is a good thing and makes it an interesting shot, I''d be interested to know how you achieved this.  I kinda wish you''d dusted that lamp though....probably just the clean freak in me speaking out. And the title bugs me as its well lit and doesn''t have the feel of a late night.', '2008-03-20 15:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4577320, 659243, 19708, '<td valign="top">Oh the shame! Using a Crescent Wrench! *wink* <br/>Good shot here, though a tad harsh in my opinion - looks like it was a desired effect in post-processing too. What really makes this work is getting just enough of his uniform insignia there.</td>', 'Oh the shame! Using a Crescent Wrench! *wink* Good shot here, though a tad harsh in my opinion - looks like it was a desired effect in post-processing too. What really makes this work is getting just enough of his uniform insignia there.', '2008-03-20 16:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
