(4577333, 659192, 19708, '<td valign="top">I see you used Photoshop Elements to do the Post-Processing on this and offer a couple things that would have really helped this. To correct some of the washed-out look and general lack of contrast, a simple Auto-Level adjustment could have been done, then edit, fade auto-level adjustment to about 75%. Another thing that is hurting this is the image compression, causing a lot of compression artifacts / blotchy sections. When saving the image for a challenge, use the Save for Web method and use the full 150Kb available for the challenges. That method will remove all the non-image data from the file and bring the quality way up.</td>', 'I see you used Photoshop Elements to do the Post-Processing on this and offer a couple things that would have really helped this. To correct some of the washed-out look and general lack of contrast, a simple Auto-Level adjustment could have been done, then edit, fade auto-level adjustment to about 75%. Another thing that is hurting this is the image compression, causing a lot of compression artifacts / blotchy sections. When saving the image for a challenge, use the Save for Web method and use the full 150Kb available for the challenges. That method will remove all the non-image data from the file and bring the quality way up.', '2008-03-20 16:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4577343, 659063, 70689, '<td valign="top">I as going to say something like "I would like to see a little more environment" and then I saw the reflected plane. Superb! Hope you won''t get too many low votes from people that miss the plane. 9</td>', 'I as going to say something like "I would like to see a little more environment" and then I saw the reflected plane. Superb! Hope you won''t get too many low votes from people that miss the plane. 9', '2008-03-20 16:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
