(4578029, 657878, 21304, '<td valign="top">I like that the photo offers a great to look at and appreciate. On the other hand, I think that the placement of the model in the photo just isn''t quite right as my eyes are automatically drawn to the big stacks of break in the middle/right. Almost feels like I''m looking at bread standing beside a person almost. 6</td>', 'I like that the photo offers a great to look at and appreciate. On the other hand, I think that the placement of the model in the photo just isn''t quite right as my eyes are automatically drawn to the big stacks of break in the middle/right. Almost feels like I''m looking at bread standing beside a person almost. 6', '2008-03-20 23:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578035, 657185, 21304, '<td valign="top">It''s an awesome photo, regardless of the challenge. Now within the framework of the challenge, I''m trying to figure out what''s going on. What''s his passion? Flying? Running through the snow barefoot and jumping all funky-like only to land on his face? Had this been a free study, I''d give 8. For this challenge, I''m giving a 6. At the same time I''m still curious if there is something that I''m missing.</td>', 'It''s an awesome photo, regardless of the challenge. Now within the framework of the challenge, I''m trying to figure out what''s going on. What''s his passion? Flying? Running through the snow barefoot and jumping all funky-like only to land on his face? Had this been a free study, I''d give 8. For this challenge, I''m giving a 6. At the same time I''m still curious if there is something that I''m missing.', '2008-03-21 00:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578037, 658709, 21304, '<td valign="top">Cool DOF, cool background. I''m just not too keen on the artist''s expression. There is nothing here that tells me he''s "at work".</td>', 'Cool DOF, cool background. I''m just not too keen on the artist''s expression. There is nothing here that tells me he''s "at work".', '2008-03-21 00:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
