(4578669, 658171, 90658, '<td valign="top">Sort of snap-shottish and the face is oof.</td>', 'Sort of snap-shottish and the face is oof.', '2008-03-21 12:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578670, 659068, 90658, '<td valign="top">I find this to be too grainy and noisy.  But, it is sort of an editorial slant on this challenge, so perhaps that was your intent...</td>', 'I find this to be too grainy and noisy.  But, it is sort of an editorial slant on this challenge, so perhaps that was your intent...', '2008-03-21 12:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578677, 659515, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think you captured the subject well.  Nice expression on the face and the eyes.  My only problem is that I cannot really tell the story behind the picture.  How does the L define your subject?  How is she interacting with the environment?  The only thing I get is a pretty girl waiting for a train.  Is she going shopping?  To work?  I won''t go as far as to say that this DNMC, because you obviously know the answers to my questions or you wouldn''t have taken this shot. :)</td>', 'I think you captured the subject well.  Nice expression on the face and the eyes.  My only problem is that I cannot really tell the story behind the picture.  How does the L define your subject?  How is she interacting with the environment?  The only thing I get is a pretty girl waiting for a train.  Is she going shopping?  To work?  I won''t go as far as to say that this DNMC, because you obviously know the answers to my questions or you wouldn''t have taken this shot. :)', '2008-03-21 12:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578679, 659443, 90658, '<td valign="top">The angle matches the frantic yell of your subject.  You''ve communicated his frustration with the way you presented this shot.</td>', 'The angle matches the frantic yell of your subject.  You''ve communicated his frustration with the way you presented this shot.', '2008-03-21 12:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578685, 659490, 90658, '<td valign="top">I saw your forum posting that this accidently went into the wrong challenge.  But in all reality, this challenge doesn''t specifically say that your subject has to human or animal.  For this challenge, I would have liked to see more of the struggle to survive.  Widen the shot and let us see the enviornment that this poor tree lives in.</td>', 'I saw your forum posting that this accidently went into the wrong challenge.  But in all reality, this challenge doesn''t specifically say that your subject has to human or animal.  For this challenge, I would have liked to see more of the struggle to survive.  Widen the shot and let us see the enviornment that this poor tree lives in.', '2008-03-21 13:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578695, 658770, 90658, '<td valign="top">You know, this one took me awhile.  Without the benefit of the title, I would assume that this was a bento ad.  The focus is on the bowl of food, which is great if this were a bento ad.  But in an environmental portrait, the food is not the best subject.  The environment does not define the food and the food is not interacting with the environment.  This is a WiFi spot, but you only show about 3 inches of the computer keyboard.  The girl is obviously intrested in something and is on a lunch/dinner break, but since she is out of the dof I find it frustrating to view this shot in this challenge.</td>', 'You know, this one took me awhile.  Without the benefit of the title, I would assume that this was a bento ad.  The focus is on the bowl of food, which is great if this were a bento ad.  But in an environmental portrait, the food is not the best subject.  The environment does not define the food and the food is not interacting with the environment.  This is a WiFi spot, but you only show about 3 inches of the computer keyboard.  The girl is obviously intrested in something and is on a lunch/dinner break, but since she is out of the dof I find it frustrating to view this shot in this challenge.', '2008-03-21 13:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578697, 658557, 90658, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get this shot, no reason.  Art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'I just don''t get this shot, no reason.  Art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-21 13:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578699, 658239, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is stunning on many levels.  Not the least being the facial expressions of both of your subjects.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is stunning on many levels.  Not the least being the facial expressions of both of your subjects.  Thank you.', '2008-03-21 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578706, 659243, 90658, '<td valign="top">This one was difficult for me.  I really like that he is working.  Doing what he does, in his environment.  The concentration in his face is great.  My problem is a subset of the fact that he is working, which is sort of the point of this challenge, imo.  The fact that his hands and arms show movement right up in the foreground is sort of like seeing two different shots combined into one.  The big question, do I discount what you''ve done because what you''ve done is follow the challenge?  Tough, huh?!  Now you see my problem...</td>', 'This one was difficult for me.  I really like that he is working.  Doing what he does, in his environment.  The concentration in his face is great.  My problem is a subset of the fact that he is working, which is sort of the point of this challenge, imo.  The fact that his hands and arms show movement right up in the foreground is sort of like seeing two different shots combined into one.  The big question, do I discount what you''ve done because what you''ve done is follow the challenge?  Tough, huh?!  Now you see my problem...', '2008-03-21 13:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578707, 659231, 90658, '<td valign="top">So besides leaning her head on the window, what is she doing?  Is she reading, napping listening to music?</td>', 'So besides leaning her head on the window, what is she doing?  Is she reading, napping listening to music?', '2008-03-21 13:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578712, 657934, 90658, '<td valign="top">Great ad shot for Absolut.  My question, how does the environment define the subject and how is the subject interacting with the environment?  What story is being told?</td>', 'Great ad shot for Absolut.  My question, how does the environment define the subject and how is the subject interacting with the environment?  What story is being told?', '2008-03-21 13:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578714, 658793, 90658, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous bird!  Would love to see him in action...pecking the wood, building a nest, interacting with his enviroment.</td>', 'Gorgeous bird!  Would love to see him in action...pecking the wood, building a nest, interacting with his enviroment.', '2008-03-21 13:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578716, 659227, 90658, '<td valign="top">Seems snap-shottish to me.  The colors are all very blue (I''m guessing on purpose.)</td>', 'Seems snap-shottish to me.  The colors are all very blue (I''m guessing on purpose.)', '2008-03-21 13:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578717, 659522, 90658, '<td valign="top">Cute little girl.  I actually would have liked to see her in the strawberry field, either picking the berry or walking through it.</td>', 'Cute little girl.  I actually would have liked to see her in the strawberry field, either picking the berry or walking through it.', '2008-03-21 13:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578719, 659401, 90658, '<td valign="top">Part of me thought that this was a staged shot, rather than a portrait of someone in their environment, but then I saw the face and the expression in the eyes.  Even supermodels can''t get that combo of concentration and enjoyment.  Well done!</td>', 'Part of me thought that this was a staged shot, rather than a portrait of someone in their environment, but then I saw the face and the expression in the eyes.  Even supermodels can''t get that combo of concentration and enjoyment.  Well done!', '2008-03-21 13:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578720, 659510, 90658, '<td valign="top">If you had placed a black cloth on the back side of the tank, blocking out the hallway, you''d have a wonderful aquarium shot (which I find to be difficult to do.)  This just sort of seems busy to me.</td>', 'If you had placed a black cloth on the back side of the tank, blocking out the hallway, you''d have a wonderful aquarium shot (which I find to be difficult to do.)  This just sort of seems busy to me.', '2008-03-21 13:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578724, 657219, 90658, '<td valign="top">People are probably saying things like "where''s your subject?"  "How is this a portrait?"  I am saying, creative use of the challenge.  A boat in its natural environment...the water.  My only issue is that I wonder if we can actually, honestly say that the boat is interacting with the environment and the environment tells us something about the character of the boat.  That being said, I had a hard time telling where the focal point was.  Everything is sort of flat.</td>', 'People are probably saying things like "where''s your subject?"  "How is this a portrait?"  I am saying, creative use of the challenge.  A boat in its natural environment...the water.  My only issue is that I wonder if we can actually, honestly say that the boat is interacting with the environment and the environment tells us something about the character of the boat.  That being said, I had a hard time telling where the focal point was.  Everything is sort of flat.', '2008-03-21 13:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578727, 658717, 90658, '<td valign="top">The concentration in the eyes is intense.  I would prefer a little sharper focus all around.</td>', 'The concentration in the eyes is intense.  I would prefer a little sharper focus all around.', '2008-03-21 13:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578729, 659585, 90658, '<td valign="top">Cute girl.  I would have like to see her actually playing in the garden.</td>', 'Cute girl.  I would have like to see her actually playing in the garden.', '2008-03-21 13:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578733, 659483, 40155, '<td valign="top">Great composition but not crisp.</td>', 'Great composition but not crisp.', '2008-03-21 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578736, 657730, 90658, '<td valign="top">She seems so sad.  I always pictured nymphs as being happy and free-spirited, which is why this is so powerful.  This could easily be in National Geographic or even the New York Times (in b&amp;w) and it would communicate so much. Well done!</td>', 'She seems so sad.  I always pictured nymphs as being happy and free-spirited, which is why this is so powerful.  This could easily be in National Geographic or even the New York Times (in b&w) and it would communicate so much. Well done!', '2008-03-21 13:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578739, 658303, 90658, '<td valign="top">Colors seem muted.</td>', 'Colors seem muted.', '2008-03-21 13:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578743, 657707, 90658, '<td valign="top">Way to capture that majestic look of disdain.  I would like to have seen a wider angle, showing more of the environment that this lion is in.</td>', 'Way to capture that majestic look of disdain.  I would like to have seen a wider angle, showing more of the environment that this lion is in.', '2008-03-21 13:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578747, 658143, 40155, '<td valign="top">Great pic but it seems the focus is on the guy behind the counter.  I find the guy in the foreground dominates the shot though. just my opinion</td>', 'Great pic but it seems the focus is on the guy behind the counter.  I find the guy in the foreground dominates the shot though. just my opinion', '2008-03-21 13:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578754, 659114, 40155, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pictures.  Perhaps a backdrop of the fields or the track who have been more appropriate.</td>', 'Beautiful pictures.  Perhaps a backdrop of the fields or the track who have been more appropriate.', '2008-03-21 13:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578756, 659551, 40155, '<td valign="top">too much window, too little portrait imho. Otherwise a very nice shot.</td>', 'too much window, too little portrait imho. Otherwise a very nice shot.', '2008-03-21 13:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578759, 659310, 40155, '<td valign="top">Good but a little too much shadow for me.</td>', 'Good but a little too much shadow for me.', '2008-03-21 13:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578769, 659461, 40155, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2008-03-21 13:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4578784, 657185, 40155, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the dancing in the snow.  It is a powerful image though.  Perhaps a different title would have captured your intent.</td>', 'I don''t really get the dancing in the snow.  It is a powerful image though.  Perhaps a different title would have captured your intent.', '2008-03-21 13:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
