(4578998, 659443, 41357, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 but I don''t think my vote will count as this is the only picture I feel like voting on - anyway good luck it should ribbon.</td>', 'I gave this a 10 but I don''t think my vote will count as this is the only picture I feel like voting on - anyway good luck it should ribbon.', '2008-03-21 16:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579030, 659677, 2612, '<td valign="top">A challenging subject and you did very well with it!</td>', 'A challenging subject and you did very well with it!', '2008-03-21 16:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579042, 658086, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is a noisy snapshot of a kid on a couch who apparently doesn''t want his picture taken or is oblivious to the fact.  Maybe find a more willing model.  Also, the background is distracting (the pillow, the white paper on the table, etc) and the kid is under dull lighting...2</td>', 'This is a noisy snapshot of a kid on a couch who apparently doesn''t want his picture taken or is oblivious to the fact.  Maybe find a more willing model.  Also, the background is distracting (the pillow, the white paper on the table, etc) and the kid is under dull lighting...2', '2008-03-21 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579047, 657878, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, although there is a lot going on.  The composition is well done, positioning the subject off center to her craft.  I think some cropping might help this out though, maybe by losing the right side of the shot where you see part of a stand full of bread.  The other part that distracts me is the background, particularly what looks like the kitchen area in the back.  A shallower depth of field might help this out, or possibly just having the subject standing in front of a stand, shelf, or wall full of bread that would fill the background (but that might not be possible with the stores set up)...5</td>', 'This is a nice picture, although there is a lot going on.  The composition is well done, positioning the subject off center to her craft.  I think some cropping might help this out though, maybe by losing the right side of the shot where you see part of a stand full of bread.  The other part that distracts me is the background, particularly what looks like the kitchen area in the back.  A shallower depth of field might help this out, or possibly just having the subject standing in front of a stand, shelf, or wall full of bread that would fill the background (but that might not be possible with the stores set up)...5', '2008-03-21 17:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579052, 658301, 79021, '<td valign="top">The odd boarder works well with the odd character in the picture.  The black and white conversion is nice and the background is out of focus but you can still make out what''s going on behind him.  However, I do not see how the environment says anything about "crazy Amzie." ...5 (for making an unusual boarder work)</td>', 'The odd boarder works well with the odd character in the picture.  The black and white conversion is nice and the background is out of focus but you can still make out what''s going on behind him.  However, I do not see how the environment says anything about "crazy Amzie." ...5 (for making an unusual boarder work)', '2008-03-21 17:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579053, 659260, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is an extremely busy shot.  the foreground (fruit and signs) are too dominant in this shot and the guy is almost lost in the background.  The reflection is somewhat distracting (especially since it shows his balding patters).  The lighting, which I assume is just store lighting, is coming from the top right (his left). but he is facing the opposite direction, which ends up with a dimly lit face...4</td>', 'This is an extremely busy shot.  the foreground (fruit and signs) are too dominant in this shot and the guy is almost lost in the background.  The reflection is somewhat distracting (especially since it shows his balding patters).  The lighting, which I assume is just store lighting, is coming from the top right (his left). but he is facing the opposite direction, which ends up with a dimly lit face...4', '2008-03-21 17:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579054, 659182, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot.  The bluish tones and the various lights make for a dramatic scene.  It is definitely taken from a different perspective, as this is how you would view the driver if you were in the back seat of a cab.  My only problem is that it is hard to see his face and what you can see is blurry.  In another challenge I would probably mark this higher, but being a portrait challenge I think the face is one of the most important things...5</td>', 'This is an awesome shot.  The bluish tones and the various lights make for a dramatic scene.  It is definitely taken from a different perspective, as this is how you would view the driver if you were in the back seat of a cab.  My only problem is that it is hard to see his face and what you can see is blurry.  In another challenge I would probably mark this higher, but being a portrait challenge I think the face is one of the most important things...5', '2008-03-21 17:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579057, 659210, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of a scientist in his element.  The foreground is not cluttered and the black and white conversion is well done.  The blown out background works to simplify the image.  I think he could use just a bit more light on the right side of his face, but that is probably something you could do after the challenge with a selection tool (if you feel its even necessary)...6</td>', 'This is a nice shot of a scientist in his element.  The foreground is not cluttered and the black and white conversion is well done.  The blown out background works to simplify the image.  I think he could use just a bit more light on the right side of his face, but that is probably something you could do after the challenge with a selection tool (if you feel its even necessary)...6', '2008-03-21 17:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579087, 659146, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is a simple shot and the pose is good.  However, his face could be a little sharper.  As for the challenge, I don''t see how his environment says anything about him...3</td>', 'This is a simple shot and the pose is good.  However, his face could be a little sharper.  As for the challenge, I don''t see how his environment says anything about him...3', '2008-03-21 17:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579090, 659545, 79021, '<td valign="top">It looks a guy (student maybe?) working in a shop.  However, the background is so out of focus that I don''t think you could really tell that without the title.  He is leaning on a bar, but what is the bar connected to?  it just comes out of the frame, so it is hard to associate that with any kind of equipment used by an engineer.  Also, the expression doesn''t make much sense.  He looks like he made a mistake on something but also happy....3</td>', 'It looks a guy (student maybe?) working in a shop.  However, the background is so out of focus that I don''t think you could really tell that without the title.  He is leaning on a bar, but what is the bar connected to?  it just comes out of the frame, so it is hard to associate that with any kind of equipment used by an engineer.  Also, the expression doesn''t make much sense.  He looks like he made a mistake on something but also happy....3', '2008-03-21 17:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579092, 658907, 79021, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and nice lighting on the face.  However, without the title it is just a well groomed man standing in front of a black backdrop.  The environment (nothing in this picture) does not convey anything to do with stand up comedy.    Maybe a microphone on the right would help fill the empty space on that side of the image.  And, it may be cheesy or cliche, but how bout a red brick wall for a background? ...4</td>', 'Nice portrait and nice lighting on the face.  However, without the title it is just a well groomed man standing in front of a black backdrop.  The environment (nothing in this picture) does not convey anything to do with stand up comedy.    Maybe a microphone on the right would help fill the empty space on that side of the image.  And, it may be cheesy or cliche, but how bout a red brick wall for a background? ...4', '2008-03-21 17:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579121, 657982, 79021, '<td valign="top">The tones on the mans face seem odd, a bit on the pink side.  His office isn''t very appealing, rather boring actually, so I don''t think it is the best choice for a background, or maybe just from this angle.  With the title, I think having him sitting down, maybe taking a phone call, would add more substance to this image.  Also, the metal on the floor is very distracting.  You could either try putting something over it or clone it out after the challenge...4</td>', 'The tones on the mans face seem odd, a bit on the pink side.  His office isn''t very appealing, rather boring actually, so I don''t think it is the best choice for a background, or maybe just from this angle.  With the title, I think having him sitting down, maybe taking a phone call, would add more substance to this image.  Also, the metal on the floor is very distracting.  You could either try putting something over it or clone it out after the challenge...4', '2008-03-21 18:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579125, 659546, 79021, '<td valign="top">Kind of an obvious shot but well done.  The set up is very clean and simple.  The blonde hair is almost lost in the background but I think that makes the camera stand out just that much more.  I like how the camera covers the full face in this shot, replacing it with just one "eye."  well done...6</td>', 'Kind of an obvious shot but well done.  The set up is very clean and simple.  The blonde hair is almost lost in the background but I think that makes the camera stand out just that much more.  I like how the camera covers the full face in this shot, replacing it with just one "eye."  well done...6', '2008-03-21 18:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579127, 659227, 79021, '<td valign="top">The subject is out of focus and a lot of the image is lost with the cropping on the bottom.  Positioning the subject at the top right and zooming out some might have helped add more of a dramatic feel to the image.  Also, the lighting is very flat on the subject...  4</td>', 'The subject is out of focus and a lot of the image is lost with the cropping on the bottom.  Positioning the subject at the top right and zooming out some might have helped add more of a dramatic feel to the image.  Also, the lighting is very flat on the subject...  4', '2008-03-21 18:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579131, 658968, 79021, '<td valign="top">The color and tones on this shot are great.  The background isn''t too cluttered either.  The only thing I would have liked to have seen is more focus on the face and maybe a little bit more of a view of the face. well done...6</td>', 'The color and tones on this shot are great.  The background isn''t too cluttered either.  The only thing I would have liked to have seen is more focus on the face and maybe a little bit more of a view of the face. well done...6', '2008-03-21 18:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
