(4579275, 659243, 77343, '<td valign="top">too much usm?</td>', 'too much usm?', '2008-03-21 19:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579292, 659146, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, though I would like to see a little more of his "environment", as the challenge calls for an environment that says something about the person.  Exposure-wise, I''d like to see the shadows a bit darker to give the image more depth, and unfortunately there are some blown out highlights on the hand and the face is a little overexposed.  Compositionally, I wish he was looking at the camera, instead of leading my eye out of the frame. Despite all these nit-picks, I do like the photo, and he is an interesting subject. Just needs a few technical tweaks.</td>', 'Nice portrait, though I would like to see a little more of his "environment", as the challenge calls for an environment that says something about the person.  Exposure-wise, I''d like to see the shadows a bit darker to give the image more depth, and unfortunately there are some blown out highlights on the hand and the face is a little overexposed.  Compositionally, I wish he was looking at the camera, instead of leading my eye out of the frame. Despite all these nit-picks, I do like the photo, and he is an interesting subject. Just needs a few technical tweaks.', '2008-03-21 19:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579303, 658964, 77196, '<td valign="top">Perhaps just my interpretation, but this seems a bit far away to be a "portrait". What wonderful color in the parasail!</td>', 'Perhaps just my interpretation, but this seems a bit far away to be a "portrait". What wonderful color in the parasail!', '2008-03-21 20:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579305, 659361, 77196, '<td valign="top">Know what I mean, Vern?</td>', 'Know what I mean, Vern?', '2008-03-21 20:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579331, 659152, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the red. Like the subject matter a lot. This type of shot is very difficult - a moment in passing, and probably a very nice memory. As a photo, the faces of both men are too much in shadow, and the focus of the picture is the man on the right, who is facing away from you. The focus wants to be (I think) on the man on the left, but there you have problems with the bright sun / shadow on his face. I suggest experimenting with a tighter crop that actually loses some of the man on the right, &amp; tighter to the tip of the sword. I can understand wanting to leave the lantern on the left and helmet on the right intact, but you may have to sacrifice that in order to get the most from this shot.</td>', 'Love the red. Like the subject matter a lot. This type of shot is very difficult - a moment in passing, and probably a very nice memory. As a photo, the faces of both men are too much in shadow, and the focus of the picture is the man on the right, who is facing away from you. The focus wants to be (I think) on the man on the left, but there you have problems with the bright sun / shadow on his face. I suggest experimenting with a tighter crop that actually loses some of the man on the right, & tighter to the tip of the sword. I can understand wanting to leave the lantern on the left and helmet on the right intact, but you may have to sacrifice that in order to get the most from this shot.', '2008-03-21 20:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579332, 659588, 89219, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait but she doesn''t seem to be interacting with her environment.  the punch on the bag clearly isn''t a real punch and because she''s looking away from the bag it just looks like a side note.  <br/> <br/>I''m also not fond of the shadow on the wall.  Ideally I would like to have seen her interacting with the equipment more or even better a student and with more of the gym in the background.</td>', 'This is a nice portrait but she doesn''t seem to be interacting with her environment.  the punch on the bag clearly isn''t a real punch and because she''s looking away from the bag it just looks like a side note.   I''m also not fond of the shadow on the wall.  Ideally I would like to have seen her interacting with the equipment more or even better a student and with more of the gym in the background.', '2008-03-21 20:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579334, 658968, 89405, '<td valign="top">I like the photo a lot.  My preference would be to see a little more of his face.</td>', 'I like the photo a lot.  My preference would be to see a little more of his face.', '2008-03-21 20:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579339, 658985, 77196, '<td valign="top">And an accident looking for a place to happen, and unfortunately, someone to happen to. I do hope this was staged with the car stopped.</td>', 'And an accident looking for a place to happen, and unfortunately, someone to happen to. I do hope this was staged with the car stopped.', '2008-03-21 20:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579342, 657629, 89219, '<td valign="top">As odd as it sounds I really like the sarcastic glance the horse is giving the camera....<br/>Generally speaking in this challenge I''ve scored animal shots pretty low but in this case the horse really engages with the viewer and the human really engages with the horse.</td>', 'As odd as it sounds I really like the sarcastic glance the horse is giving the camera....Generally speaking in this challenge I''ve scored animal shots pretty low but in this case the horse really engages with the viewer and the human really engages with the horse.', '2008-03-21 20:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579344, 658303, 89219, '<td valign="top">This has a sinister sci-fi feel to it.</td>', 'This has a sinister sci-fi feel to it.', '2008-03-21 20:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579354, 658342, 89219, '<td valign="top">I really like this portrait it has a fantastic sense of fun.  <br/> <br/>Unfortunately there''s no environment in the shot so I feel obliged to score lower than I think the shot is worth. 7 for this challenge, 8 maybe 9 if it was just a stand alone shot.</td>', 'I really like this portrait it has a fantastic sense of fun.   Unfortunately there''s no environment in the shot so I feel obliged to score lower than I think the shot is worth. 7 for this challenge, 8 maybe 9 if it was just a stand alone shot.', '2008-03-21 20:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579367, 659316, 77196, '<td valign="top">This just works - regardless of the "rules" - on so many levels. The framing with the curtains, the light blue of the dresses being about the only strong color in the shot, contrasted with the white of the boys shirt, the posed girls and the boy in (constant?) motion, being a statement on the nature of little boys (and young ladies), the older girls looking at the boy (the youngest girl is looking at the camera, but that also seems to add to the shot rather than detract).</td>', 'This just works - regardless of the "rules" - on so many levels. The framing with the curtains, the light blue of the dresses being about the only strong color in the shot, contrasted with the white of the boys shirt, the posed girls and the boy in (constant?) motion, being a statement on the nature of little boys (and young ladies), the older girls looking at the boy (the youngest girl is looking at the camera, but that also seems to add to the shot rather than detract).', '2008-03-21 20:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579449, 659626, 25183, '<td valign="top">My son sees a Dr. Gutierrez for cardiology...funny!  I like this...it''s not too busy!  Not easy to do in a physicians environment.</td>', 'My son sees a Dr. Gutierrez for cardiology...funny!  I like this...it''s not too busy!  Not easy to do in a physicians environment.', '2008-03-21 22:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
