(4579544, 659401, 63503, '<td valign="top">A couple of thoughts to improve an already good image: 1.- softer light (I realise you may have not had control of this), 2.- wider diaphragm for shallower DOF, 3.- I think this would look great in B&amp;W (8)</td>', 'A couple of thoughts to improve an already good image: 1.- softer light (I realise you may have not had control of this), 2.- wider diaphragm for shallower DOF, 3.- I think this would look great in B&W (8)', '2008-03-22 01:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
