(4579555, 659383, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great portrait</td>', 'Great portrait', '2008-03-22 01:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579559, 658609, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting. I am just not sure about the composition; the small section of background visible between the columns to the right is distracting. The centered subject looks a bit weird. (7)</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting. I am just not sure about the composition; the small section of background visible between the columns to the right is distracting. The centered subject looks a bit weird. (7)', '2008-03-22 01:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579560, 658091, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot. Too bad about the distracting background, shallower DOF would have helped, as would conversion to B&amp;W.</td>', 'Great candid shot. Too bad about the distracting background, shallower DOF would have helped, as would conversion to B&W.', '2008-03-22 01:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579587, 658709, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast of color of the palette versus the painting - nice work putting your subject into his environment.</td>', 'I really like the contrast of color of the palette versus the painting - nice work putting your subject into his environment.', '2008-03-22 01:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579591, 659065, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the natural framing in this.  My only nit is the light on the foreground plants kinda pulls me away from the subject''s face.  That said, I really do like the natural, relaxed pose you captured.</td>', 'I like the natural framing in this.  My only nit is the light on the foreground plants kinda pulls me away from the subject''s face.  That said, I really do like the natural, relaxed pose you captured.', '2008-03-22 01:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579592, 658079, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The angles work well here, but it''s her expression that really makes the shot.  I very much like the textures as well.</td>', 'Lovely.  The angles work well here, but it''s her expression that really makes the shot.  I very much like the textures as well.', '2008-03-22 02:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579594, 657707, 30982, '<td valign="top">He still looks very regal, doesn''t he?</td>', 'He still looks very regal, doesn''t he?', '2008-03-22 02:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579595, 658109, 30982, '<td valign="top">An engaging shot to me - much to see and explore.</td>', 'An engaging shot to me - much to see and explore.', '2008-03-22 02:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579597, 659210, 30982, '<td valign="top">At first the distortion is a bit disconcerting but it really does lend itself well to this portrait - the science is the thing, or at least it is presented that way.  Two things that would make this a better portrait - just a bit deeper DOF and cloning out the labels on the machine (which I fully understand isn''t allowed under the rules of the challenge.)  Very good work.</td>', 'At first the distortion is a bit disconcerting but it really does lend itself well to this portrait - the science is the thing, or at least it is presented that way.  Two things that would make this a better portrait - just a bit deeper DOF and cloning out the labels on the machine (which I fully understand isn''t allowed under the rules of the challenge.)  Very good work.', '2008-03-22 02:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579641, 658522, 65779, '<td valign="top">She looks a wholesome home-grown sort!  Nice image too.</td>', 'She looks a wholesome home-grown sort!  Nice image too.', '2008-03-22 03:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579645, 658709, 65779, '<td valign="top">I think the focus was on the hat / shirt rather than the eyes.  This is going to hurt this shot which was otherwise well lit and composed.</td>', 'I think the focus was on the hat / shirt rather than the eyes.  This is going to hurt this shot which was otherwise well lit and composed.', '2008-03-22 03:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
