(4579732, 659203, 89219, '<td valign="top">As a scientist this picture offers me hope, thank you.<br/>Really nice shot, I like the fact the white lab coat and in her skin are a little to bright making the picture extra sharp.</td>', 'As a scientist this picture offers me hope, thank you.Really nice shot, I like the fact the white lab coat and in her skin are a little to bright making the picture extra sharp.', '2008-03-22 06:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579790, 659344, 86799, '<td valign="top">THAT is what''s meant by an "environmental portrait".  Powerful and well presented.</td>', 'THAT is what''s meant by an "environmental portrait".  Powerful and well presented.', '2008-03-22 08:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
