(4579795, 659666, 86799, '<td valign="top">Hey, I think I quoted the electrical on those plans!  Haha.  Good work, though, you''ve given it a nice tired, stressed but professional feel.</td>', 'Hey, I think I quoted the electrical on those plans!  Haha.  Good work, though, you''ve given it a nice tired, stressed but professional feel.', '2008-03-22 08:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
