(4579805, 658985, 86799, '<td valign="top">I think I tried to merge onto the interstate behind her just last week!</td>', 'I think I tried to merge onto the interstate behind her just last week!', '2008-03-22 09:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579808, 659060, 86799, '<td valign="top">More of a candid than a portrait.  But OK.</td>', 'More of a candid than a portrait.  But OK.', '2008-03-22 09:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579811, 659588, 86799, '<td valign="top">A little too "posed".  She should be punishing that bag, and enjoying it.</td>', 'A little too "posed".  She should be punishing that bag, and enjoying it.', '2008-03-22 09:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579812, 658404, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but more of a documentary than a portrait.</td>', 'Nice picture, but more of a documentary than a portrait.', '2008-03-22 09:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579815, 658143, 86799, '<td valign="top">This is good.  You can almost hear the orders flying, smell the fish.  These guys are in their element.  Proper environmental portrait.</td>', 'This is good.  You can almost hear the orders flying, smell the fish.  These guys are in their element.  Proper environmental portrait.', '2008-03-22 09:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579817, 659670, 86799, '<td valign="top">You don''t give us a clue as to why she''s looking up.  A little noisy and disorganized.</td>', 'You don''t give us a clue as to why she''s looking up.  A little noisy and disorganized.', '2008-03-22 09:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579851, 658983, 46295, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is perfect for this photo...I like the way your framed this and the use of the background to complement the subject</td>', 'B&W is perfect for this photo...I like the way your framed this and the use of the background to complement the subject', '2008-03-22 09:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579852, 659162, 46295, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2008-03-22 09:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579855, 659515, 46295, '<td valign="top">The way your subject is lit makes this photo work for me...great use of depth of field -- gives this image a 3D effect</td>', 'The way your subject is lit makes this photo work for me...great use of depth of field -- gives this image a 3D effect', '2008-03-22 09:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579856, 659676, 46295, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...great colors and framing</td>', 'Nicely done...great colors and framing', '2008-03-22 09:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579991, 659635, 90380, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of reflections, and it''s great how it not only shows his environment behind him, but all around him including in front. Nice one. One thing I would suggest is to balance out the colour cast a bit.</td>', 'Interesting use of reflections, and it''s great how it not only shows his environment behind him, but all around him including in front. Nice one. One thing I would suggest is to balance out the colour cast a bit.', '2008-03-22 11:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580010, 658287, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice lookin'' dude! ;-) I really like how most of the picture is darker tones. This is one of my faves.</td>', 'Nice lookin'' dude! ;-) I really like how most of the picture is darker tones. This is one of my faves.', '2008-03-22 11:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580014, 659426, 80904, '<td valign="top">the 4HIAM is a dead giveaway :P</td>', 'the 4HIAM is a dead giveaway :P', '2008-03-22 11:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580021, 658829, 90380, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a nice looking bedroom! I really like this one, especially how she is illuminated by the glow of the computer, it really emphasizes the point. The only problem I see is that it slopes to the right slightly.</td>', 'Wow, what a nice looking bedroom! I really like this one, especially how she is illuminated by the glow of the computer, it really emphasizes the point. The only problem I see is that it slopes to the right slightly.', '2008-03-22 11:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580023, 659662, 80904, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle of this shot. Well done 8</td>', 'I really like the angle of this shot. Well done 8', '2008-03-22 11:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580025, 658826, 20662, '<td valign="top">while this is a stunning portrait -- it doesn''t show the lovely young ladies environment. I adore her freckles!</td>', 'while this is a stunning portrait -- it doesn''t show the lovely young ladies environment. I adore her freckles!', '2008-03-22 11:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580051, 659585, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, though for this challenge, I would have liked to see more of the environment. Something about the exposure bothers me a bit, like it is too grey and muddy-ish. Looks like you may have tried to decrease the contrast to compensate for the harsh lighting, but went a little too far. I tried doing a levels adjustment in Photoshop, and it seems that simply giving it a true white and black point made quite a difference. Makes it pop and look more natural too.</td>', 'Nice portrait, though for this challenge, I would have liked to see more of the environment. Something about the exposure bothers me a bit, like it is too grey and muddy-ish. Looks like you may have tried to decrease the contrast to compensate for the harsh lighting, but went a little too far. I tried doing a levels adjustment in Photoshop, and it seems that simply giving it a true white and black point made quite a difference. Makes it pop and look more natural too.', '2008-03-22 12:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580052, 659383, 68599, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Love the detail in the skin and the sharpness.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Love the detail in the skin and the sharpness.', '2008-03-22 12:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580056, 659688, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! I really like everything about this except that it is slightly over-saturated, and unfortunately it makes the guy look like he''s wearing makeup!</td>', 'Nice capture! I really like everything about this except that it is slightly over-saturated, and unfortunately it makes the guy look like he''s wearing makeup!', '2008-03-22 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580057, 659490, 68599, '<td valign="top">Not a portrait sorry.</td>', 'Not a portrait sorry.', '2008-03-22 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580058, 658907, 68599, '<td valign="top">Don''t really understand the environment part. It says stand-up comic but there''s no mic or something to indicate he''s a comic. Technically speaking though it''s a nice portrait.</td>', 'Don''t really understand the environment part. It says stand-up comic but there''s no mic or something to indicate he''s a comic. Technically speaking though it''s a nice portrait.', '2008-03-22 12:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580069, 659236, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, but it looks like you have decreased the contrast too much, and the shadows look grey and muddy. IMO it needs a levels adjustment to give it a true black point, and then desaturate the reds a little to get rid of that colour cast on the skin. Cute baby!</td>', 'Very nicely composed, but it looks like you have decreased the contrast too much, and the shadows look grey and muddy. IMO it needs a levels adjustment to give it a true black point, and then desaturate the reds a little to get rid of that colour cast on the skin. Cute baby!', '2008-03-22 12:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580073, 658091, 90380, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. The only thing I would change, if possible, would be to wait till those other people were out of the frame, as they are rather distracting from the person we are supposed to be looking at.</td>', 'I like this one a lot. The only thing I would change, if possible, would be to wait till those other people were out of the frame, as they are rather distracting from the person we are supposed to be looking at.', '2008-03-22 12:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580085, 658710, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very well done! There are just 2 things I would change: first, exposure-wise, it appears slightly underexposed, so a 1/3 stop brighter would have been nice from the get-go, but since it is already done, a levels adjustment to give it a true white point helps out. Second, it would been sooo nice if there were some nice and healthy, pretty flowers on the ground behind her head, rather than those sickly-looking bushy things. That would have really made this portrait stand out IMHO.</td>', 'Very well done! There are just 2 things I would change: first, exposure-wise, it appears slightly underexposed, so a 1/3 stop brighter would have been nice from the get-go, but since it is already done, a levels adjustment to give it a true white point helps out. Second, it would been sooo nice if there were some nice and healthy, pretty flowers on the ground behind her head, rather than those sickly-looking bushy things. That would have really made this portrait stand out IMHO.', '2008-03-22 12:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580094, 659235, 90380, '<td valign="top">Cute! I like the composition, but a) there seems to be a bit of a motion blur, and b) I would have manipulated the DOF to include the emu (unless the blurriness is just more motion blur?), as he is as important to the portrait as the woman is. Since the bushes behind are more in focus than the emu, you probably would have been safe to focus on the emu, then both of them would have been within the DOF. Also, a slightly softer expression on her face would have made the portrait easier to stay looking at.</td>', 'Cute! I like the composition, but a) there seems to be a bit of a motion blur, and b) I would have manipulated the DOF to include the emu (unless the blurriness is just more motion blur?), as he is as important to the portrait as the woman is. Since the bushes behind are more in focus than the emu, you probably would have been safe to focus on the emu, then both of them would have been within the DOF. Also, a slightly softer expression on her face would have made the portrait easier to stay looking at.', '2008-03-22 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580096, 658826, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, but we can''t see any of her environment, which is crucial to this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, but we can''t see any of her environment, which is crucial to this challenge.', '2008-03-22 12:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580097, 659203, 90380, '<td valign="top">It is a nicely done portrait, but IMO, an environmental portrait should tell us something about the personality of the subject. In this, all we know is that she is a model, but that the environment is a facade, so we don''t really know <i>her</i>.</td>', 'It is a nicely done portrait, but IMO, an environmental portrait should tell us something about the personality of the subject. In this, all we know is that she is a model, but that the environment is a facade, so we don''t really know her.', '2008-03-22 12:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580101, 659383, 90380, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, but I wish we could see some of his environment.</td>', 'Great portrait, but I wish we could see some of his environment.', '2008-03-22 12:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580105, 659677, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done portrait, and the girl has a great expression to show the anguish of that age. The only thing that defeats the challenge is the out of focus background. The environment is an important feature for this challenge, as long as it illustrates the personality of the subject.</td>', 'Very nicely done portrait, and the girl has a great expression to show the anguish of that age. The only thing that defeats the challenge is the out of focus background. The environment is an important feature for this challenge, as long as it illustrates the personality of the subject.', '2008-03-22 12:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580108, 659238, 30982, '<td valign="top">A cool shot, but in my mind this doesn''t meet the challenge.  Edit - my bad.  Apparently the challenge is anything in an environment.  I''ll adjust accordingly.  (Last one was a person specifically.)</td>', 'A cool shot, but in my mind this doesn''t meet the challenge.  Edit - my bad.  Apparently the challenge is anything in an environment.  I''ll adjust accordingly.  (Last one was a person specifically.)', '2008-03-22 13:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580114, 659391, 90380, '<td valign="top">Interesting character, you are really bang-on for this challenge! Couple of things I can critique are a) I would have removed that thing of earrings or whatever they are, from in front of the subject, b) have the guy step forward a bit if possible, so he is more prominent and not quite so overtaken by all the clutter, and c) decrease the contrast, as it is a little too strong for my taste. Again though, great subject AND environment, this is one of my faves.</td>', 'Interesting character, you are really bang-on for this challenge! Couple of things I can critique are a) I would have removed that thing of earrings or whatever they are, from in front of the subject, b) have the guy step forward a bit if possible, so he is more prominent and not quite so overtaken by all the clutter, and c) decrease the contrast, as it is a little too strong for my taste. Again though, great subject AND environment, this is one of my faves.', '2008-03-22 13:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580116, 659483, 90380, '<td valign="top">Would be awesome if only he was in focus.</td>', 'Would be awesome if only he was in focus.', '2008-03-22 13:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580124, 659538, 90380, '<td valign="top">Aaawwwwww.</td>', 'Aaawwwwww.', '2008-03-22 13:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580127, 659394, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and POV, but I find the lighting a bit harsh.</td>', 'Nice composition and POV, but I find the lighting a bit harsh.', '2008-03-22 13:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580133, 658907, 90380, '<td valign="top">Well-done portrait, but I wish I could see some of his environment.</td>', 'Well-done portrait, but I wish I could see some of his environment.', '2008-03-22 13:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580153, 659060, 88422, '<td valign="top">Quality shot!</td>', 'Quality shot!', '2008-03-22 13:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580154, 658907, 88422, '<td valign="top">We don''t get enough photos that show emotion like this.  I thought this guy looked like he would be funny before I read the title, I really like it.</td>', 'We don''t get enough photos that show emotion like this.  I thought this guy looked like he would be funny before I read the title, I really like it.', '2008-03-22 13:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580159, 657504, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice and unusual study, possibly could have done with either a slightly shallower dof or the contrast tweaking in pp to make it stand out more but nevertheless a good photo as is.  The eyes of your subject are particularly impressive and tell a tale of years past<br/> <br/>Nice job</td>', 'Very nice and unusual study, possibly could have done with either a slightly shallower dof or the contrast tweaking in pp to make it stand out more but nevertheless a good photo as is.  The eyes of your subject are particularly impressive and tell a tale of years past Nice job', '2008-03-22 13:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580161, 659635, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice image for the challenge and anyone who not only works on harleys but also lets you take photos of them has got to be cool.  Love the sharpness of the reflection in the chrome.  Good strong colours as well</td>', 'Very nice image for the challenge and anyone who not only works on harleys but also lets you take photos of them has got to be cool.  Love the sharpness of the reflection in the chrome.  Good strong colours as well', '2008-03-22 13:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580163, 658877, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oooooooooo man this is EXACTLY the sort of picture that sprung to mind when I read the challenge dtitle, however from reading threads on the challenge it appears that environmental portrait means something quite different.  No doubt you are getting dinged all over the shop for this interpretation, but looking at it in the spirit that it was taken I would say that it is a nice ''message'' shot, though perhaps could have been a touch sharper</td>', 'Oooooooooo man this is EXACTLY the sort of picture that sprung to mind when I read the challenge dtitle, however from reading threads on the challenge it appears that environmental portrait means something quite different.  No doubt you are getting dinged all over the shop for this interpretation, but looking at it in the spirit that it was taken I would say that it is a nice ''message'' shot, though perhaps could have been a touch sharper', '2008-03-22 13:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580165, 659383, 68035, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately (if that is the right word to use) this portrait is so good that it actually looks like a studio shot with a made up model rather than of a shift worker in their natural environment.  I am sure this is an image that the voters will either love or take a tad of glee in telling you that it does not meet the challenge.  From my own perspective I am just really inpressed by the the muted colours and the sharpness of the subject<br/> <br/>Excellent portrait</td>', 'Unfortunately (if that is the right word to use) this portrait is so good that it actually looks like a studio shot with a made up model rather than of a shift worker in their natural environment.  I am sure this is an image that the voters will either love or take a tad of glee in telling you that it does not meet the challenge.  From my own perspective I am just really inpressed by the the muted colours and the sharpness of the subject Excellent portrait', '2008-03-22 13:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580168, 659662, 68035, '<td valign="top">Really like the point of view on this shop, I just hoped you dont get dinged because there are no fish in site (salting and icing tables is absolutely valid as far as I am concerned for the challenge)<br/> <br/>Nice dof and a very striking image</td>', 'Really like the point of view on this shop, I just hoped you dont get dinged because there are no fish in site (salting and icing tables is absolutely valid as far as I am concerned for the challenge) Nice dof and a very striking image', '2008-03-22 13:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580169, 659182, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!!!  Great perspective and a strong black and white conversions (optikverve dramatic?).  Really glad that you got the meter in the shot.  Excellent sharpness for a night shot<br/> <br/>Good job</td>', 'Very nice!!!!  Great perspective and a strong black and white conversions (optikverve dramatic?).  Really glad that you got the meter in the shot.  Excellent sharpness for a night shot Good job', '2008-03-22 14:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580170, 659477, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ver bice subtle image and an interesting POV.  The harsh white (grey) sky has actually contributed to the image by giving the subject a degree more pop, perhaps a shame there is not a colliery wheel in the background - although a counter argument could be made that a touch of subtlty is a good thing<br/> <br/>Very nice portrait</td>', 'Ver bice subtle image and an interesting POV.  The harsh white (grey) sky has actually contributed to the image by giving the subject a degree more pop, perhaps a shame there is not a colliery wheel in the background - although a counter argument could be made that a touch of subtlty is a good thing Very nice portrait', '2008-03-22 14:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580171, 659440, 68035, '<td valign="top">An intriguing shot, no doubt that there will be some that say because the subject does not appear to be aware the shot is being taken it is not a ''pure'' portrait, but in this instance I dont think it matters.<br/> <br/>The real thing that will make this shot ''suffer'' at the hands of voters is likely to be the blur in the lower fifth of the image (not sure whether this is another person who crept in shot or vignetting, but it is quite distracting from a very interesting subject</td>', 'An intriguing shot, no doubt that there will be some that say because the subject does not appear to be aware the shot is being taken it is not a ''pure'' portrait, but in this instance I dont think it matters. The real thing that will make this shot ''suffer'' at the hands of voters is likely to be the blur in the lower fifth of the image (not sure whether this is another person who crept in shot or vignetting, but it is quite distracting from a very interesting subject', '2008-03-22 14:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580173, 658287, 68035, '<td valign="top">What a great image of ''western'' USA.  Superb portrait and an outstanding black and white conversion.  I have no doubt the subject (human not equine) in this shot would absolutely love a copy of this image.  Strong conceptually and technically<br/> <br/>Very nice</td>', 'What a great image of ''western'' USA.  Superb portrait and an outstanding black and white conversion.  I have no doubt the subject (human not equine) in this shot would absolutely love a copy of this image.  Strong conceptually and technically Very nice', '2008-03-22 14:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580175, 659152, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with very strong colours and a great moment in time (perhaps moreso than a portrait) capture.  I almost feel like saying I wish it was not quite so tight so you could see a tad more of Buck Pal, but if you did open up the image then I have no doubt I would be saying I wish you had gone tighter on the guardsmen, which I guess just goes to prove you are damned if you do and you are damned if you dont</td>', 'Nice shot with very strong colours and a great moment in time (perhaps moreso than a portrait) capture.  I almost feel like saying I wish it was not quite so tight so you could see a tad more of Buck Pal, but if you did open up the image then I have no doubt I would be saying I wish you had gone tighter on the guardsmen, which I guess just goes to prove you are damned if you do and you are damned if you dont', '2008-03-22 14:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580177, 658907, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, although I am not sure it screams stand up comic to me.  Compositionally strong and I like the slightly unusual positioning of the subject.  Good technicals. especially given his checked shirt</td>', 'Nice portrait, although I am not sure it screams stand up comic to me.  Compositionally strong and I like the slightly unusual positioning of the subject.  Good technicals. especially given his checked shirt', '2008-03-22 14:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580180, 658989, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice nice nice!  Great capture of a person in their environment but also pretty spectacular in terms of the way the beams frame the subject - most notably the head, but the right hand and torso as well.  Good strong colours and nice sharpness 9</td>', 'Nice nice nice!  Great capture of a person in their environment but also pretty spectacular in terms of the way the beams frame the subject - most notably the head, but the right hand and torso as well.  Good strong colours and nice sharpness 9', '2008-03-22 14:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580185, 659171, 68035, '<td valign="top">Tremendous shot which really meets the challenge head on.  More than just a good idea though, it has been executed wonderfully, from the great black and white conversion, to the way the principal is looking directly at camera, to the lovely motion blur of the students traipsing past<br/> <br/>a wonderful 9</td>', 'Tremendous shot which really meets the challenge head on.  More than just a good idea though, it has been executed wonderfully, from the great black and white conversion, to the way the principal is looking directly at camera, to the lovely motion blur of the students traipsing past a wonderful 9', '2008-03-22 14:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580187, 659300, 68035, '<td valign="top">ooooooooo a headless portrait....I bet you will have some voters frothing at the mouth over this.  As for me I really like it it, very cool composition which just shouts ''rock musician'', possibly a smidgin over harsh on the left arm and right hand but still swimming in an ocean of cool</td>', 'ooooooooo a headless portrait....I bet you will have some voters frothing at the mouth over this.  As for me I really like it it, very cool composition which just shouts ''rock musician'', possibly a smidgin over harsh on the left arm and right hand but still swimming in an ocean of cool', '2008-03-22 14:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580189, 659060, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interestingly even as a Brit my first temptation was to think ''oh no not another shot of the democratic candidate...seen him a million times'' but then when you stop to think about it this is a phenomenal photo for DPC.  Outstanding sharpness and proximity, great colours and without a shadow of a doubt meets the challenge as well as any other photo.  I hope you dont suffer from voter fatigue (political rather than DPC).  An out and out 10 from me<br/> <br/>Remarkable</td>', 'Interestingly even as a Brit my first temptation was to think ''oh no not another shot of the democratic candidate...seen him a million times'' but then when you stop to think about it this is a phenomenal photo for DPC.  Outstanding sharpness and proximity, great colours and without a shadow of a doubt meets the challenge as well as any other photo.  I hope you dont suffer from voter fatigue (political rather than DPC).  An out and out 10 from me Remarkable', '2008-03-22 14:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580192, 658330, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ooooooo...Great take on the challenge, brilliant composition and fantastic colours...unfortunately (imo) the focus seems just a touch soft (a bit tighter and I think it would have been the blue ribbon winner)<br/> <br/>Still a very strong image congratulations</td>', 'Ooooooo...Great take on the challenge, brilliant composition and fantastic colours...unfortunately (imo) the focus seems just a touch soft (a bit tighter and I think it would have been the blue ribbon winner) Still a very strong image congratulations', '2008-03-22 14:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580195, 659361, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wooooah.  A photo that just stops you in your tracks, great use of fish eye to create a really interesting portrait.  Outstanding sharpness and nice splash of colour as well<br/> <br/>If I am being picky perhaps I would have liked to either see more tools of the trade or him to have more paint splashes, but still an excellent 8 (for the moment I may be back to bump up)</td>', 'Wooooah.  A photo that just stops you in your tracks, great use of fish eye to create a really interesting portrait.  Outstanding sharpness and nice splash of colour as well If I am being picky perhaps I would have liked to either see more tools of the trade or him to have more paint splashes, but still an excellent 8 (for the moment I may be back to bump up)', '2008-03-22 14:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580199, 659344, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice traditional boxing pose which no doubt the subject will love.  The Ali poster adds a very nice touch.  the ring ropes are a lot more subtle (in fact I wonder whether every one will see them) but again serve to add to the environment.  Strong BW conversion - 8</td>', 'Nice traditional boxing pose which no doubt the subject will love.  The Ali poster adds a very nice touch.  the ring ropes are a lot more subtle (in fact I wonder whether every one will see them) but again serve to add to the environment.  Strong BW conversion - 8', '2008-03-22 14:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580205, 659063, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait and the capture of the jet in the sunglasses is a n excellent touch which really enhances it in terms of the challenge.  Not 100% sure of the B&amp;W conversion which seems a little soft for the subject matter and which perhaps lacks a touch of pop<br/> <br/>Still a good image - 7</td>', 'Very nice portrait and the capture of the jet in the sunglasses is a n excellent touch which really enhances it in terms of the challenge.  Not 100% sure of the B&W conversion which seems a little soft for the subject matter and which perhaps lacks a touch of pop Still a good image - 7', '2008-03-22 14:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580238, 659061, 46295, '<td valign="top">Nice colors however I am not sure what the subject is here the coupld or the chapel...</td>', 'Nice colors however I am not sure what the subject is here the coupld or the chapel...', '2008-03-22 15:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580240, 658115, 46295, '<td valign="top">I like the setting and the way you framed it</td>', 'I like the setting and the way you framed it', '2008-03-22 15:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580246, 659072, 46295, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture - I like the lighting here - the brightly lit meat on the left and the darkeness to the right really works for me and esp. the way your subject is illuminated....lover to know you got this exposure and effect...</td>', 'Very interesting picture - I like the lighting here - the brightly lit meat on the left and the darkeness to the right really works for me and esp. the way your subject is illuminated....lover to know you got this exposure and effect...', '2008-03-22 15:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580248, 658330, 46295, '<td valign="top">Cool - just an awesome picture the way you captured the flying sparks!</td>', 'Cool - just an awesome picture the way you captured the flying sparks!', '2008-03-22 15:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580250, 657935, 46295, '<td valign="top">I like the color and tonal range of this photo...</td>', 'I like the color and tonal range of this photo...', '2008-03-22 15:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580279, 658287, 70484, '<td valign="top">I love this capture. It''s perfect in B&amp;W and I really like that the shadows aren''t too dark. The lighting is really good on his face. 10</td>', 'I love this capture. It''s perfect in B&W and I really like that the shadows aren''t too dark. The lighting is really good on his face. 10', '2008-03-22 15:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580293, 658115, 70484, '<td valign="top">First off, his face is just too precious! I love it! The soft coloring is fantastic. 10</td>', 'First off, his face is just too precious! I love it! The soft coloring is fantastic. 10', '2008-03-22 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580294, 659171, 70484, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. The movement from the children really makes this shot. And the banner just states pretty much what a principal does. Thanks for showcasing an often ignored profession. Especially one which is so powerful in launching the hopes and dreams of so many children. 10</td>', 'I really like this picture. The movement from the children really makes this shot. And the banner just states pretty much what a principal does. Thanks for showcasing an often ignored profession. Especially one which is so powerful in launching the hopes and dreams of so many children. 10', '2008-03-22 16:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580295, 659238, 70484, '<td valign="top">WOW! 10</td>', 'WOW! 10', '2008-03-22 16:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580301, 658829, 30896, '<td valign="top">Nice one. The blue light is cool - does it work automatically, or it needs some enhancement?</td>', 'Nice one. The blue light is cool - does it work automatically, or it needs some enhancement?', '2008-03-22 16:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580310, 659238, 30896, '<td valign="top">Well done, pleasant to look at, original... Would be close to 10 from me, were I be able to find something in the picture related to the challenge.</td>', 'Well done, pleasant to look at, original... Would be close to 10 from me, were I be able to find something in the picture related to the challenge.', '2008-03-22 16:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580431, 658079, 76335, '<td valign="top">Perfect. The monochrome tones are excellent, and the lighting and focus are dead on.</td>', 'Perfect. The monochrome tones are excellent, and the lighting and focus are dead on.', '2008-03-22 18:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580436, 659470, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors, DOF and POV. Would like it better if his face were more visible.</td>', 'Excellent colors, DOF and POV. Would like it better if his face were more visible.', '2008-03-22 18:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580437, 659543, 76335, '<td valign="top">A great pose and the set up is perfect. Would like to have seen better focus in her face.</td>', 'A great pose and the set up is perfect. Would like to have seen better focus in her face.', '2008-03-22 18:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580438, 658886, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. More of a candid than a portrait, but an honest photograph of the subject doing his thing.</td>', 'Nice capture. More of a candid than a portrait, but an honest photograph of the subject doing his thing.', '2008-03-22 18:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580440, 658143, 76335, '<td valign="top">Might work better if it showed him frying something. Still very good...</td>', 'Might work better if it showed him frying something. Still very good...', '2008-03-22 18:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580442, 659404, 76335, '<td valign="top">He''s a little too clean cut for this to be too convincing. And his tool looks brand new. Technically very good though...</td>', 'He''s a little too clean cut for this to be too convincing. And his tool looks brand new. Technically very good though...', '2008-03-22 18:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580443, 659677, 76335, '<td valign="top">Really captures the mood associated with that age. Nice.</td>', 'Really captures the mood associated with that age. Nice.', '2008-03-22 18:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580444, 657982, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice framing. Funny!</td>', 'Nice framing. Funny!', '2008-03-22 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580445, 659048, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but not really a portrait of either one of them. Go Bucs!</td>', 'Nice capture, but not really a portrait of either one of them. Go Bucs!', '2008-03-22 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580447, 658684, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is (mural? movie?) or how it fits the challenge. Original idea, anyway...</td>', 'Not sure what this is (mural? movie?) or how it fits the challenge. Original idea, anyway...', '2008-03-22 18:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580451, 658877, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s not a portrait...</td>', 'Well, it''s not a portrait...', '2008-03-22 18:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580460, 659391, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good job of immersing the man in his environment. It''s ironic and empathetic at the same time.</td>', 'Good job of immersing the man in his environment. It''s ironic and empathetic at the same time.', '2008-03-22 19:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580461, 659470, 50695, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo. It''s like Diane Arbus meets the Village People.</td>', 'Stunning photo. It''s like Diane Arbus meets the Village People.', '2008-03-22 19:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580466, 659316, 50695, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t strike me as an environmental portrait, per se, but it''s a great photo capturing the best possible moment and putting it into the best possible composition. So I''ll give it a 7 just for being fantastic.</td>', 'This doesn''t strike me as an environmental portrait, per se, but it''s a great photo capturing the best possible moment and putting it into the best possible composition. So I''ll give it a 7 just for being fantastic.', '2008-03-22 19:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580471, 659171, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good-bye hopes and dreams! They''re flying into the sky, never to return! <br/> <br/>In <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52713" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">scarbrd</a>''s portrait, I got the sense of a woman as a stable presence amid the chaos of children. Here, I see the principal remaining year after year as the children keep passing through. They go up up and away into their lives, taking their hopes and dreams with them.</td>', 'Good-bye hopes and dreams! They''re flying into the sky, never to return!  In  scarbrd''s portrait, I got the sense of a woman as a stable presence amid the chaos of children. Here, I see the principal remaining year after year as the children keep passing through. They go up up and away into their lives, taking their hopes and dreams with them.', '2008-03-22 19:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580473, 659236, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the contrived, artful arrangement.</td>', 'I like the contrived, artful arrangement.', '2008-03-22 19:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580475, 659231, 50695, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m a big believer in portraits from behind. Sometimes a person''s face distracts us from her humanity. Or maybe I''m just looking for any excuse to give such a beautiful picture a high score.</td>', 'Ok, I''m a big believer in portraits from behind. Sometimes a person''s face distracts us from her humanity. Or maybe I''m just looking for any excuse to give such a beautiful picture a high score.', '2008-03-22 19:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580476, 658301, 50695, '<td valign="top">There''s a great sense of defiance to this.</td>', 'There''s a great sense of defiance to this.', '2008-03-22 19:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580477, 657504, 50695, '<td valign="top">You made the garbage look so beautiful! this photo reminds me of the Mona Lisa.</td>', 'You made the garbage look so beautiful! this photo reminds me of the Mona Lisa.', '2008-03-22 19:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580478, 659444, 50695, '<td valign="top">Textbook environmental portrait. I get a real sense of what this man does and where he does it.</td>', 'Textbook environmental portrait. I get a real sense of what this man does and where he does it.', '2008-03-22 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580479, 658989, 50695, '<td valign="top">gotta love those diagonals!</td>', 'gotta love those diagonals!', '2008-03-22 19:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580480, 658983, 50695, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem like a portrait, but what a great photo! It certainly does show a man interacting with his environment.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem like a portrait, but what a great photo! It certainly does show a man interacting with his environment.', '2008-03-22 19:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580481, 659610, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice energetic composition that fulfills the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Nice energetic composition that fulfills the challenge perfectly.', '2008-03-22 19:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580483, 659551, 50695, '<td valign="top">surrounding him by a hierarchical geometry was a bold and appropriate move. This is a great example of the genre.</td>', 'surrounding him by a hierarchical geometry was a bold and appropriate move. This is a great example of the genre.', '2008-03-22 19:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580484, 658968, 50695, '<td valign="top">perfectly captured moment, and the perfect moment to capture.</td>', 'perfectly captured moment, and the perfect moment to capture.', '2008-03-22 19:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580485, 658264, 50695, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2008-03-22 19:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580488, 659477, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the literally edgy composition.</td>', 'I love the literally edgy composition.', '2008-03-22 19:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580489, 659243, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great job! Dynamic composition, perfect moment, etc.</td>', 'Great job! Dynamic composition, perfect moment, etc.', '2008-03-22 19:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580490, 658709, 50695, '<td valign="top">the photo itself seems like an abstract painting that he lives inside of.</td>', 'the photo itself seems like an abstract painting that he lives inside of.', '2008-03-22 19:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580494, 659635, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice touch using the reflection. It creates a very exciting photo.</td>', 'Nice touch using the reflection. It creates a very exciting photo.', '2008-03-22 19:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580495, 659101, 50695, '<td valign="top">Love the nostalgic, ancient feeling of this.</td>', 'Love the nostalgic, ancient feeling of this.', '2008-03-22 19:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580498, 659662, 50695, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture of someone in action, doing what they do. He is completely in the moment and you caught him there.</td>', 'Perfect capture of someone in action, doing what they do. He is completely in the moment and you caught him there.', '2008-03-22 19:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580506, 658115, 60173, '<td valign="top">I love the soft tans of this photo. However, your little sailor''s face loses in competition with the sunset. I''m not sure what lighting tools you have available, but some light reflected up at his face would brighten those rosy cheeks and make him the dominate subject. Outside of this challenge a quick dodging of his face in Photoshop gives the same effect.<br/> <br/>Lovely photo, none-the-less.</td>', 'I love the soft tans of this photo. However, your little sailor''s face loses in competition with the sunset. I''m not sure what lighting tools you have available, but some light reflected up at his face would brighten those rosy cheeks and make him the dominate subject. Outside of this challenge a quick dodging of his face in Photoshop gives the same effect. Lovely photo, none-the-less.', '2008-03-22 19:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580509, 659065, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like that you captured the environment first, with the subject having to get "down in the dirt" so to speak. The crop (no pun intended) might be a little too tight for that matter, but the lighting and even the black-and-white is perfect.</td>', 'I like that you captured the environment first, with the subject having to get "down in the dirt" so to speak. The crop (no pun intended) might be a little too tight for that matter, but the lighting and even the black-and-white is perfect.', '2008-03-22 19:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580512, 658609, 76335, '<td valign="top">A different POV closer to the subject might have worked better here.</td>', 'A different POV closer to the subject might have worked better here.', '2008-03-22 19:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580514, 659636, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and soft focus.</td>', 'Nice tones and soft focus.', '2008-03-22 19:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580517, 659300, 76335, '<td valign="top">That''s brave! I like this but even a sliver of head, I think, might have been better received. Nice harsh contrast and colors though -- fits the subject matter.</td>', 'That''s brave! I like this but even a sliver of head, I think, might have been better received. Nice harsh contrast and colors though -- fits the subject matter.', '2008-03-22 19:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580518, 659666, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing -- almost looks like an illustration. Nice capture though (and he can have the late nights).</td>', 'Interesting processing -- almost looks like an illustration. Nice capture though (and he can have the late nights).', '2008-03-22 19:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580519, 659072, 60173, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and well balanced. There''s a lot going on, but it doesn''t seem cluttered. You''ve created a nice centralized flow for the viewer. I''m also a sucker for muted colors like these, and there''s great contrast balance.<br/> <br/>As commentary, that butcher scares the crap out of me, heh.</td>', 'Very interesting and well balanced. There''s a lot going on, but it doesn''t seem cluttered. You''ve created a nice centralized flow for the viewer. I''m also a sucker for muted colors like these, and there''s great contrast balance. As commentary, that butcher scares the crap out of me, heh.', '2008-03-22 19:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580520, 657219, 76335, '<td valign="top">Where''s the portrait?</td>', 'Where''s the portrait?', '2008-03-22 19:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580522, 658301, 76335, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly captured his crazy side -- interesting border.</td>', 'You''ve certainly captured his crazy side -- interesting border.', '2008-03-22 19:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580525, 658829, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great colors, lighting.</td>', 'Great colors, lighting.', '2008-03-22 19:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580526, 658303, 76335, '<td valign="top">Technically not great, but WOW! -- interesting stuff going on there...</td>', 'Technically not great, but WOW! -- interesting stuff going on there...', '2008-03-22 19:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580527, 659257, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is really good, but a little more of his hammer would have helped.</td>', 'This is really good, but a little more of his hammer would have helped.', '2008-03-22 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580532, 659072, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s the Salvador Dali of the meat rack. Nice.</td>', 'It''s the Salvador Dali of the meat rack. Nice.', '2008-03-22 20:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580535, 658909, 76335, '<td valign="top">Portrait?</td>', 'Portrait?', '2008-03-22 20:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580536, 659238, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalism and the negative space. But where''s the portrait?</td>', 'I like the minimalism and the negative space. But where''s the portrait?', '2008-03-22 20:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580542, 659069, 76335, '<td valign="top">Studing? This is good, but seems a little too staged. Interesting lighting.</td>', 'Studing? This is good, but seems a little too staged. Interesting lighting.', '2008-03-22 20:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580546, 658287, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice low key poratrait.</td>', 'Nice low key poratrait.', '2008-03-22 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580553, 658826, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not much environment outside of the title, but a beautiful portrrait anyway.</td>', 'Not much environment outside of the title, but a beautiful portrrait anyway.', '2008-03-22 20:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580555, 657185, 76335, '<td valign="top">Having trouble reconciling his craft to the environment. Interesting anyway...</td>', 'Having trouble reconciling his craft to the environment. Interesting anyway...', '2008-03-22 20:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580556, 658985, 76335, '<td valign="top">This warrior''s hardly ready to be taking to the road. Unfortunately, a not uncommon sight.</td>', 'This warrior''s hardly ready to be taking to the road. Unfortunately, a not uncommon sight.', '2008-03-22 20:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580557, 659063, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks a little too posed, but a nice shot anyway.</td>', 'Looks a little too posed, but a nice shot anyway.', '2008-03-22 20:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580559, 657935, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but it looks a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice capture, but it looks a little oversharpened.', '2008-03-22 20:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580563, 658091, 76335, '<td valign="top">Terrific. You can feel his charm!</td>', 'Terrific. You can feel his charm!', '2008-03-22 20:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580564, 658286, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Nice framing with the license plate. Having spent my teen years in Louisiana, the portrait takes on a whole new meaning for me. AN eight for you.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Nice framing with the license plate. Having spent my teen years in Louisiana, the portrait takes on a whole new meaning for me. AN eight for you.', '2008-03-22 20:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580567, 659361, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little too up close and initimate for me, but I think that was the point. This makes me laugh. Nice job! A seven for you.</td>', 'A little too up close and initimate for me, but I think that was the point. This makes me laugh. Nice job! A seven for you.', '2008-03-22 20:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580568, 658625, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and grain. Do I hear the <i>Cheers</i> theme?</td>', 'Nice tones and grain. Do I hear the Cheers theme?', '2008-03-22 20:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
