(4580658, 659171, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of blur, and this is especially nice in B/W. Tells the story well. Good job.</td>', 'Very effective use of blur, and this is especially nice in B/W. Tells the story well. Good job.', '2008-03-22 21:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
