(4581866, 659182, 91011, '<td valign="top">This picture has such a nice "feel" to it. The busy blurr outside is a great contrast to the calm serenity inside the taxi. The blue, grainy texture works well with the night setting as it fades to black near the edges giving the picture a slightly mysterious look. Well done.</td>', 'This picture has such a nice "feel" to it. The busy blurr outside is a great contrast to the calm serenity inside the taxi. The blue, grainy texture works well with the night setting as it fades to black near the edges giving the picture a slightly mysterious look. Well done.', '2008-03-23 21:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
