(4582919, 658091, 60573, '<td valign="top">One of the best shot for this challenge. I hope you get a ribbon. The main character is so candid, and so in the street, as well as the lady in the background. Well done.</td>', 'One of the best shot for this challenge. I hope you get a ribbon. The main character is so candid, and so in the street, as well as the lady in the background. Well done.', '2008-03-24 09:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4582921, 659192, 60573, '<td valign="top">IMHO DMC.</td>', 'IMHO DMC.', '2008-03-24 09:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583101, 659203, 90658, '<td valign="top">I get the humor here.  I totally understand that this is satire.  That bing said, I think you would be more successful playing it staright here.  Either get a model doing what models do or find an actual scientist.  As far as shot goes, creative and colorful.  The white lab coat is blown out and it is affecting the skin tone of your model, causing the face to appear pale and the eyes sort of disappear into the hair.</td>', 'I get the humor here.  I totally understand that this is satire.  That bing said, I think you would be more successful playing it staright here.  Either get a model doing what models do or find an actual scientist.  As far as shot goes, creative and colorful.  The white lab coat is blown out and it is affecting the skin tone of your model, causing the face to appear pale and the eyes sort of disappear into the hair.', '2008-03-24 10:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583107, 659670, 90658, '<td valign="top">So why is she inside?  What keeps her there?  There is a wistful look that hints that she wants to be outside, but we don''t know why.  The environment is more important than the subject in something like this.  The idea is to see how the environment affects the subject (defines them) and how the subject interacts with their environment.  We see the later, but not in a context that defines "why".</td>', 'So why is she inside?  What keeps her there?  There is a wistful look that hints that she wants to be outside, but we don''t know why.  The environment is more important than the subject in something like this.  The idea is to see how the environment affects the subject (defines them) and how the subject interacts with their environment.  We see the later, but not in a context that defines "why".', '2008-03-24 10:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583109, 657866, 90658, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but this one eludes me.  No reason, art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'I am sorry but this one eludes me.  No reason, art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-24 10:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583114, 658676, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well put together, the reflection in the glasses adds something, you see his pure enjoyment, not just a posed smile (it could be posed...who knows).  We see the environment and it''s definition on the subject and we see him interacting within that environment.  Thank you.</td>', 'Well put together, the reflection in the glasses adds something, you see his pure enjoyment, not just a posed smile (it could be posed...who knows).  We see the environment and it''s definition on the subject and we see him interacting within that environment.  Thank you.', '2008-03-24 10:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583121, 659065, 90658, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  The b&amp;w makes this kind of harsh.  The facial expression and body position of the subject sort of make it look creepy.  This is not a happy shot, imo.  The shadows in the face make the face seem evil.  Sorry, this could have been a brilliant shot, but I think you inadvertantly communicated the wrong emotions in your presentation.</td>', 'Hmmm.  The b&w makes this kind of harsh.  The facial expression and body position of the subject sort of make it look creepy.  This is not a happy shot, imo.  The shadows in the face make the face seem evil.  Sorry, this could have been a brilliant shot, but I think you inadvertantly communicated the wrong emotions in your presentation.', '2008-03-24 10:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583131, 658877, 90658, '<td valign="top">Finally figured this one out.  The tree is the "subject" the ice and frigid water is the environment.  This was difficult for me because the focus does not seem to be on the tree.  In fact, I couldn''t find any element that had enough focus to be the actual subject.  Now, I will admit a higher pixilated shot might be different.  This could be stunning in the raw, but reducing it might have "damaged" the focus.  So the fact that I think it is oof might not be the reality of things.  It just makes it seem real flat to me.</td>', 'Finally figured this one out.  The tree is the "subject" the ice and frigid water is the environment.  This was difficult for me because the focus does not seem to be on the tree.  In fact, I couldn''t find any element that had enough focus to be the actual subject.  Now, I will admit a higher pixilated shot might be different.  This could be stunning in the raw, but reducing it might have "damaged" the focus.  So the fact that I think it is oof might not be the reality of things.  It just makes it seem real flat to me.', '2008-03-24 10:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583138, 658907, 90658, '<td valign="top">Strange situation for me.  As a portrait, I really like this shot.  Great expression, nice angle of shot and nice angle of subject.  Good coloring, all the things that make good portraits.  There is no environment except a black cloth.  So there is nothing to define your subject except the title.  And here is where it gets weird...the title actually detracts for the portrait.  Obviously, he is a stand-up comic by profession and you are telling us this.  But by the title, I expect a different sort of portrait presentation.  This puts me in an odd position for voting...</td>', 'Strange situation for me.  As a portrait, I really like this shot.  Great expression, nice angle of shot and nice angle of subject.  Good coloring, all the things that make good portraits.  There is no environment except a black cloth.  So there is nothing to define your subject except the title.  And here is where it gets weird...the title actually detracts for the portrait.  Obviously, he is a stand-up comic by profession and you are telling us this.  But by the title, I expect a different sort of portrait presentation.  This puts me in an odd position for voting...', '2008-03-24 10:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583142, 658972, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the concentration in his face.  My only suggestion, I would have liked to see him playing the pipes.</td>', 'I like the concentration in his face.  My only suggestion, I would have liked to see him playing the pipes.', '2008-03-24 10:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583144, 659359, 90658, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t do it for me.  Art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'This just doesn''t do it for me.  Art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-24 10:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583145, 659391, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is fun!  The environment definitely defines the subject.  The subject is obviously serious about his environment.</td>', 'This is fun!  The environment definitely defines the subject.  The subject is obviously serious about his environment.', '2008-03-24 10:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583150, 659126, 90658, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you able to capture this without suffering from the anger of the momma.  However, this doesn''t spaek to me in the context of this challenge.  Art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'Don''t know how you able to capture this without suffering from the anger of the momma.  However, this doesn''t spaek to me in the context of this challenge.  Art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-24 10:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583153, 659300, 90658, '<td valign="top">Everything is blown out and the colors are extremely harsh.  Plus, I would submit that the idea of a portrait is to show your subject''s face.</td>', 'Everything is blown out and the colors are extremely harsh.  Plus, I would submit that the idea of a portrait is to show your subject''s face.', '2008-03-24 10:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583162, 658951, 90658, '<td valign="top">This looks like a catalog shot in wide angle.  How does this environment define the subject?  And why is he pointing?  (I get the intent from the title).  If I saw that title without the picture, I would imagine a totally different scene...one that involved my subject actually attempting to get home.  I think you had a good start and probably could have done more with this.</td>', 'This looks like a catalog shot in wide angle.  How does this environment define the subject?  And why is he pointing?  (I get the intent from the title).  If I saw that title without the picture, I would imagine a totally different scene...one that involved my subject actually attempting to get home.  I think you had a good start and probably could have done more with this.', '2008-03-24 10:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583163, 658709, 90658, '<td valign="top">The shadows under the hat are a little too low.  You are losing part of that intense stare.  And the stare is what draws me into this shot.</td>', 'The shadows under the hat are a little too low.  You are losing part of that intense stare.  And the stare is what draws me into this shot.', '2008-03-24 10:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583171, 659060, 90658, '<td valign="top">The environment is clearly defined and is clearly defining your subject.  Your subject is doing what he does in this environment.  All elements of this challenge are here.  I think your downfall is that Obama is such an animated speaker and this shot doesn''t really capture that.  It''s hard, when your subject is so well known, to really capture what the public already knows about him.  It''s like he just finished something wonderful, or he is about to open up and let the personality come through.  This shot is right in the middle.</td>', 'The environment is clearly defined and is clearly defining your subject.  Your subject is doing what he does in this environment.  All elements of this challenge are here.  I think your downfall is that Obama is such an animated speaker and this shot doesn''t really capture that.  It''s hard, when your subject is so well known, to really capture what the public already knows about him.  It''s like he just finished something wonderful, or he is about to open up and let the personality come through.  This shot is right in the middle.', '2008-03-24 11:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583175, 659632, 90658, '<td valign="top">Everything is too blown out for my tastes.  This causes me to not even give things the attention that they deserve.  I guess that is why art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'Everything is too blown out for my tastes.  This causes me to not even give things the attention that they deserve.  I guess that is why art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-24 11:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583177, 659332, 90658, '<td valign="top">This seems almost like an editorial portrait.  The despair is communicated, but I am having a difficult time seeing this as an environmental portrait.</td>', 'This seems almost like an editorial portrait.  The despair is communicated, but I am having a difficult time seeing this as an environmental portrait.', '2008-03-24 11:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583187, 658200, 90658, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t pop for me.  Colors are blown and I had to rely on the title to figure out your intent.  Environmental Portraits shouldn''t be so abstract in presentation (not abstract in the art sense...I guess a better word would be obtuse) that you need a title to tell everyone what is going on, imo.  My biggest problem is why would a relatively well-dressed young women be in scrap lumber yard?  She doesn''t work there, she isn''t a run-a-way.  If you''re trying to juxtapose teen angst against an editorial comment on the "scrap" there are much better ways of doing that.</td>', 'This doesn''t pop for me.  Colors are blown and I had to rely on the title to figure out your intent.  Environmental Portraits shouldn''t be so abstract in presentation (not abstract in the art sense...I guess a better word would be obtuse) that you need a title to tell everyone what is going on, imo.  My biggest problem is why would a relatively well-dressed young women be in scrap lumber yard?  She doesn''t work there, she isn''t a run-a-way.  If you''re trying to juxtapose teen angst against an editorial comment on the "scrap" there are much better ways of doing that.', '2008-03-24 11:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583194, 659069, 90658, '<td valign="top">Slight nit-picky thing here...the reason I can tell this posed.  She is holding a pencil and her paper is buried under books.  I would like to see her really studing, not showing us how she studys.  Also, along the posed line...I have never seen anyone smile while they are studying late at night.  Just an observation.</td>', 'Slight nit-picky thing here...the reason I can tell this posed.  She is holding a pencil and her paper is buried under books.  I would like to see her really studing, not showing us how she studys.  Also, along the posed line...I have never seen anyone smile while they are studying late at night.  Just an observation.', '2008-03-24 11:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583196, 659636, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think the coloring hurt you a bit.  This looks "dirty" to me.  How was b&amp;w?  Did you try color?  I''d be interested is seeing the shots you didn''t use.</td>', 'I think the coloring hurt you a bit.  This looks "dirty" to me.  How was b&w?  Did you try color?  I''d be interested is seeing the shots you didn''t use.', '2008-03-24 11:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583197, 659518, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer more profile or at least 3/4 of the face.  It also seems oof.</td>', 'I''d prefer more profile or at least 3/4 of the face.  It also seems oof.', '2008-03-24 11:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583200, 659444, 90658, '<td valign="top">Unfortuantely, your subject is fighting the sun.  His eyes are squinted and he is looking slightly down in an attempt to keep them open.  You can also see the brow-line is squinshed and not in a thoughtful way.</td>', 'Unfortuantely, your subject is fighting the sun.  His eyes are squinted and he is looking slightly down in an attempt to keep them open.  You can also see the brow-line is squinshed and not in a thoughtful way.', '2008-03-24 11:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583204, 659688, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is an intersting shot.  The facial expression does not communicate enjoyment or concentration.  Nice action shot.</td>', 'This is an intersting shot.  The facial expression does not communicate enjoyment or concentration.  Nice action shot.', '2008-03-24 11:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583206, 659171, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Especially since the kids are blurred out from motion.</td>', 'I like this.  Especially since the kids are blurred out from motion.', '2008-03-24 11:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583212, 658558, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is just a question...does this person always wear that much eye make-up when they are tree doctoring?  I come from a family of orchard owners and I''ve never seen a tree doctor wear any make-up or even have their clothes that clean.  I think your downfall with me, is that I have experience and first-hand knowledge and memories to pull from so this shot does not communicate to me what my memories flash before my eyes.  That being said, the profile is nice.  The focus is inspired.  I have a little problem with all of the pink, but that is where art comes in.</td>', 'This is just a question...does this person always wear that much eye make-up when they are tree doctoring?  I come from a family of orchard owners and I''ve never seen a tree doctor wear any make-up or even have their clothes that clean.  I think your downfall with me, is that I have experience and first-hand knowledge and memories to pull from so this shot does not communicate to me what my memories flash before my eyes.  That being said, the profile is nice.  The focus is inspired.  I have a little problem with all of the pink, but that is where art comes in.', '2008-03-24 11:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583216, 659257, 90658, '<td valign="top">So is he a carpenter or a model?  I just ask because part of this challenge was to capture the person in their environment.  Imo, he is not "in his environment."  He is inside a construction zone, but he is not immersed in it.  No hard hat, short pants are questionable attire for construction zones, he is way to clean...just little details, but they add up.</td>', 'So is he a carpenter or a model?  I just ask because part of this challenge was to capture the person in their environment.  Imo, he is not "in his environment."  He is inside a construction zone, but he is not immersed in it.  No hard hat, short pants are questionable attire for construction zones, he is way to clean...just little details, but they add up.', '2008-03-24 11:24:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4583217, 658264, 90658, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t speak to me.  No reason, I just find it blah!  Such is art.</td>', 'This just doesn''t speak to me.  No reason, I just find it blah!  Such is art.', '2008-03-24 11:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583223, 659235, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''d be willing to bet that a lot of folks aren''t going to like this shot.  I however love it.  I''m sure you will get omments like "snap-shottish" but I am going to say...yes, there is an <i>element</i> of snap-shot, an <i>element</i> of the candid.  But they are all add up to capture someone in their environment.  The environment defines the subject and tells us something about her and she is doing what she does within that environment.  Well done.</td>', 'I''d be willing to bet that a lot of folks aren''t going to like this shot.  I however love it.  I''m sure you will get omments like "snap-shottish" but I am going to say...yes, there is an element of snap-shot, an element of the candid.  But they are all add up to capture someone in their environment.  The environment defines the subject and tells us something about her and she is doing what she does within that environment.  Well done.', '2008-03-24 11:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583228, 657935, 90658, '<td valign="top">This has the beginnings of a wonderful piece of art.  This is where my inexpereince with photography is going to show through.  I cannot pinpoint exactly where this off.  I have no idea as to why this seem just shy of a perfect shot.  This tells me that it must be something in technique or processing.  As I am not a photographer, I cannot help you with those things.  I would suggest sending this to the Critque Club or posting it one of the forum threads for more advice.</td>', 'This has the beginnings of a wonderful piece of art.  This is where my inexpereince with photography is going to show through.  I cannot pinpoint exactly where this off.  I have no idea as to why this seem just shy of a perfect shot.  This tells me that it must be something in technique or processing.  As I am not a photographer, I cannot help you with those things.  I would suggest sending this to the Critque Club or posting it one of the forum threads for more advice.', '2008-03-24 11:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583230, 659546, 90658, '<td valign="top">Everything above the neck disappears into the background.  The coloring is too harsh my liking.  Art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'Everything above the neck disappears into the background.  The coloring is too harsh my liking.  Art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-24 11:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583231, 659538, 90658, '<td valign="top">Art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'Art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-24 11:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583239, 659404, 90658, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...brand new hard-hat, brand new sledge hammer, brand new clothes, brand new glasses, not a speck of dirt anywhere.  This is a great commercial shot, a nice advertisment.  As an environmental portrait, I am not convinced this person really does demolition.  Coloring is nice.  I like the building in the back, but as I said, these components make it a great catalog or commercial shot.</td>', 'Hmmm...brand new hard-hat, brand new sledge hammer, brand new clothes, brand new glasses, not a speck of dirt anywhere.  This is a great commercial shot, a nice advertisment.  As an environmental portrait, I am not convinced this person really does demolition.  Coloring is nice.  I like the building in the back, but as I said, these components make it a great catalog or commercial shot.', '2008-03-24 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583382, 658983, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/7/7 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 7/6/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical: 6/6 <br/>Presentation: 7 <br/>Total: 6.4 <br/>Vote: 7 <br/> <br/>Remarks: The forte here, beyond the quiet amusement it may evoke, is how well the measured givens of the scene are integrated compositionally and aesthetically. This, to my sense and eye, is certainly more than what we''d expect from any <i>found</i> candid and better than a mere <i>capture</i> of (a) subject(s). <br/> <br/>The nearly athletic back-bracing of the photographer portrayed here is reminiscent of an archer rather than that of a man with a small pocket camera taking in the sights. The contrast between this posture and any other one we would commonly associate with a man in the attire of the Hasidim is as taut as the imaginary bow he appears to span and just as surprising.<br/> <br/>I increased my score of this entry to accommodate the amount of interest this entry stirred in me even after studying it for more than one hour.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/7/7 Composition/perspective/manner: 7/6/6 Aesthetics/Technical: 6/6 Presentation: 7 Total: 6.4 Vote: 7  Remarks: The forte here, beyond the quiet amusement it may evoke, is how well the measured givens of the scene are integrated compositionally and aesthetically. This, to my sense and eye, is certainly more than what we''d expect from any found candid and better than a mere capture of (a) subject(s).  The nearly athletic back-bracing of the photographer portrayed here is reminiscent of an archer rather than that of a man with a small pocket camera taking in the sights. The contrast between this posture and any other one we would commonly associate with a man in the attire of the Hasidim is as taut as the imaginary bow he appears to span and just as surprising. I increased my score of this entry to accommodate the amount of interest this entry stirred in me even after studying it for more than one hour.', '2008-03-24 12:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583400, 657878, 34255, '<td valign="top">Very fitting for this challenge.</td>', 'Very fitting for this challenge.', '2008-03-24 12:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583407, 659443, 34255, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and creative photo.  I just have a hard time considering it in the context of this challenge, since I''m not sure what the "environment" is or how exactly the guy fits into that environment.</td>', 'Very interesting and creative photo.  I just have a hard time considering it in the context of this challenge, since I''m not sure what the "environment" is or how exactly the guy fits into that environment.', '2008-03-24 12:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583419, 659690, 34255, '<td valign="top">Technically a good photo, with good composition and exposure, etc.  I feel like the "environment" in this image is a little plain and doesn''t tell us anything about the people.</td>', 'Technically a good photo, with good composition and exposure, etc.  I feel like the "environment" in this image is a little plain and doesn''t tell us anything about the people.', '2008-03-24 12:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583423, 659203, 34255, '<td valign="top">Great image! I love the colors and the pose.  The dress she''s wearing makes her slightly less convincing as a scientist.</td>', 'Great image! I love the colors and the pose.  The dress she''s wearing makes her slightly less convincing as a scientist.', '2008-03-24 12:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583702, 658826, 91812, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful catch.</td>', 'What a wonderful catch.', '2008-03-24 15:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583719, 658985, 61958, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, good thing she''s not moving</td>', 'Interesting photo, good thing she''s not moving', '2008-03-24 15:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583721, 659676, 61958, '<td valign="top">Very cute. I like the vibrant colours</td>', 'Very cute. I like the vibrant colours', '2008-03-24 15:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583722, 658171, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Good Color.  Need a little less exposure, perhaps by increasing the shutter to a higher amount.  Also careful on your focusing.  This one is not quite tack sharp.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Good Color.  Need a little less exposure, perhaps by increasing the shutter to a higher amount.  Also careful on your focusing.  This one is not quite tack sharp.', '2008-03-24 15:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583723, 658609, 61958, '<td valign="top">nice photo, there are some dark spots at the bottom that I''m not fond of, which is too bad</td>', 'nice photo, there are some dark spots at the bottom that I''m not fond of, which is too bad', '2008-03-24 15:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583725, 659440, 61958, '<td valign="top">too bad about whatever is in the way at the bottom, would have been a much better phot otherwise.</td>', 'too bad about whatever is in the way at the bottom, would have been a much better phot otherwise.', '2008-03-24 15:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583726, 659636, 61958, '<td valign="top">lvoely, peacefull photo, love the ones as well</td>', 'lvoely, peacefull photo, love the ones as well', '2008-03-24 15:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583727, 658877, 61958, '<td valign="top">great framing and capture</td>', 'great framing and capture', '2008-03-24 15:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583729, 659316, 35602, '<td valign="top">Overall it would make a nice group shot for an album.  Some problems include white balance being off.  Perhaps you need to use a flourescent setting.  Though the boy is blurred because of motion,which is fine, the girls are also lacking in really good sharpness.  You also left too much space around them, which adds very little to the image.  Cropping more to focus on the people would have enhanced the photo.</td>', 'Overall it would make a nice group shot for an album.  Some problems include white balance being off.  Perhaps you need to use a flourescent setting.  Though the boy is blurred because of motion,which is fine, the girls are also lacking in really good sharpness.  You also left too much space around them, which adds very little to the image.  Cropping more to focus on the people would have enhanced the photo.', '2008-03-24 15:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583732, 658968, 61958, '<td valign="top">nice capture of the moment... I think a sightly fater shutter speed would have helped this photo a bit more</td>', 'nice capture of the moment... I think a sightly fater shutter speed would have helped this photo a bit more', '2008-03-24 15:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583733, 658939, 61958, '<td valign="top">lovely photo and framing. very creative. well done</td>', 'lovely photo and framing. very creative. well done', '2008-03-24 15:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583735, 658301, 61958, '<td valign="top">that''s some set of glasses :) great photo!</td>', 'that''s some set of glasses :) great photo!', '2008-03-24 15:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583736, 659060, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  Well done.  Great dof and sharpness and exposure is also right on.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  Well done.  Great dof and sharpness and exposure is also right on.', '2008-03-24 15:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583739, 658989, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.  Love the angle and the contrast of color.  Very well composed.</td>', 'Really nice shot.  Love the angle and the contrast of color.  Very well composed.', '2008-03-24 15:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583750, 657982, 61958, '<td valign="top">great posing and photo. whatever that is on the floor is very distrating, maybe a different angle to avoid that? also bouncing the flash a little higher up (if it''s not an on-board) would have helped as well.</td>', 'great posing and photo. whatever that is on the floor is very distrating, maybe a different angle to avoid that? also bouncing the flash a little higher up (if it''s not an on-board) would have helped as well.', '2008-03-24 16:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583753, 659401, 61958, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture and colours, everything about this photo speaks to the character of the subject. great job!</td>', 'beautiful capture and colours, everything about this photo speaks to the character of the subject. great job!', '2008-03-24 16:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
