(4585247, 658091, 61958, '<td valign="top">love the capture and the expression. would have liked a bit shallower Dof to make those people behind him less distracting.</td>', 'love the capture and the expression. would have liked a bit shallower Dof to make those people behind him less distracting.', '2008-03-25 10:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585251, 658972, 61958, '<td valign="top">great photo, well captured.</td>', 'great photo, well captured.', '2008-03-25 10:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585255, 658079, 61958, '<td valign="top">as the title suggests I''m might have liked to see a bit more of the street. othewise beautiful photo.</td>', 'as the title suggests I''m might have liked to see a bit more of the street. othewise beautiful photo.', '2008-03-25 10:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585323, 657219, 32767, '<td valign="top">Whats'' missing...or what am I missing???</td>', 'Whats'' missing...or what am I missing???', '2008-03-25 10:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585332, 659260, 32767, '<td valign="top">It seems like you oveplayed the environment and underplayed your subject.</td>', 'It seems like you oveplayed the environment and underplayed your subject.', '2008-03-25 10:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585333, 658968, 45790, '<td valign="top">You are fighting terrible lighting here. Jacket shoulder and sleeve are blown. White Balance is off. Face in shadow.</td>', 'You are fighting terrible lighting here. Jacket shoulder and sleeve are blown. White Balance is off. Face in shadow.', '2008-03-25 10:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585338, 659461, 45790, '<td valign="top">Very nice, indeed! The framing, and utilizing the reflection from the mirror on the lid, are want makes this picture.</td>', 'Very nice, indeed! The framing, and utilizing the reflection from the mirror on the lid, are want makes this picture.', '2008-03-25 10:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585342, 659515, 32767, '<td valign="top">I usually look for a connection between the subject and the environment and how it shows a peice of their personality (candid or posed). I don''t really see it here in any direction. I''m not sure why you placed her in this environment...unless she works or lives in the Underground???</td>', 'I usually look for a connection between the subject and the environment and how it shows a peice of their personality (candid or posed). I don''t really see it here in any direction. I''m not sure why you placed her in this environment...unless she works or lives in the Underground???', '2008-03-25 10:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585347, 659551, 32767, '<td valign="top">Quite top heavy in your hoice of crop. I think the upper 2/3''s of the image underplay your subject. With a whole church and a willing model I would have gone for something different. Just an opinion.</td>', 'Quite top heavy in your hoice of crop. I think the upper 2/3''s of the image underplay your subject. With a whole church and a willing model I would have gone for something different. Just an opinion.', '2008-03-25 10:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585359, 658303, 45790, '<td valign="top">Funny! I also like her pose for the camera.</td>', 'Funny! I also like her pose for the camera.', '2008-03-25 10:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585360, 658907, 32767, '<td valign="top">There may be an environment here but it''s not discernable. It''s a nice image otherwise so I hope you''re not getting killed by your score.</td>', 'There may be an environment here but it''s not discernable. It''s a nice image otherwise so I hope you''re not getting killed by your score.', '2008-03-25 10:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585364, 659238, 32767, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve heard it all before....? <br/> <br/>I think this shot of a Pilot flying his plane meets the Challenge dead on despite all the DNMC''s you are getting. The expression on his face is priceless...one of humor, contol and total confidence. I would feel completely safe flying with him behind the controls. Good Luck, 10.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve heard it all before....?  I think this shot of a Pilot flying his plane meets the Challenge dead on despite all the DNMC''s you are getting. The expression on his face is priceless...one of humor, contol and total confidence. I would feel completely safe flying with him behind the controls. Good Luck, 10.', '2008-03-25 10:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585367, 659388, 45790, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. Good angles. I also like just getting the second musician into the frame, just enough OOF so as not to distract from the main subject but yet add to the topic.</td>', 'Lovely portrait. Good angles. I also like just getting the second musician into the frame, just enough OOF so as not to distract from the main subject but yet add to the topic.', '2008-03-25 10:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585372, 659388, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. While candids can certainly be portraits I''m not sure this one fits (by my rules...which a are very loose). For me there needs to be some repose and maybe a little awareness of the camera or else it''s a pure action shot.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. While candids can certainly be portraits I''m not sure this one fits (by my rules...which a are very loose). For me there needs to be some repose and maybe a little awareness of the camera or else it''s a pure action shot.', '2008-03-25 10:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585378, 658989, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good angle, composition. I also like the contrasting colors. You don''t have to see the entire building to get the "whole picture".</td>', 'Good angle, composition. I also like the contrasting colors. You don''t have to see the entire building to get the "whole picture".', '2008-03-25 10:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585379, 659068, 32767, '<td valign="top">Smeagol (Lord Of The Rings) ?</td>', 'Smeagol (Lord Of The Rings) ?', '2008-03-25 10:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585381, 657185, 32767, '<td valign="top">I''m confused...</td>', 'I''m confused...', '2008-03-25 10:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4585386, 657317, 45790, '<td valign="top">I guess there is a place for wide-angle lenses in portrait photography. Stunning! And there is also the dramatic lighting...</td>', 'I guess there is a place for wide-angle lenses in portrait photography. Stunning! And there is also the dramatic lighting...', '2008-03-25 10:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
