(4586574, 659391, 84124, '<td valign="top">Well well, how unique!  Everything about this shot screams "out there", as should any good shot in this challenge.  Congrats, excellent portrait.  Back to bump, an extra point for creativity.  8.</td>', 'Well well, how unique!  Everything about this shot screams "out there", as should any good shot in this challenge.  Congrats, excellent portrait.  Back to bump, an extra point for creativity.  8.', '2008-03-25 19:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
