(4586607, 658829, 90892, '<td valign="top">Captures how today''s youth (and the adults) are immersed in the digital world sometimes more than the 3d. I give this a 9 because of the statement it makes and the lighting on the subject that works so well to convey that point.</td>', 'Captures how today''s youth (and the adults) are immersed in the digital world sometimes more than the 3d. I give this a 9 because of the statement it makes and the lighting on the subject that works so well to convey that point.', '2008-03-25 19:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
