(4586648, 659383, 90892, '<td valign="top">would have been better if all of the helmet was in the picture. This is a great shot otherwise although I personally was looking for an external environment and not just a hat and some dirt on the face for this challenge.</td>', 'would have been better if all of the helmet was in the picture. This is a great shot otherwise although I personally was looking for an external environment and not just a hat and some dirt on the face for this challenge.', '2008-03-25 19:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
