(4586874, 658710, 70514, '<td valign="top">Lovely girl and great capture.  I wonder if catching her actually gathering the lovely flowers wouldn''t add a bit of punch to this.  This particular angle seems almost harsh on such a beautiful subject.</td>', 'Lovely girl and great capture.  I wonder if catching her actually gathering the lovely flowers wouldn''t add a bit of punch to this.  This particular angle seems almost harsh on such a beautiful subject.', '2008-03-25 21:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586876, 658772, 70514, '<td valign="top">I think a less centered crop and a bit more sharpness would have made this wonderful.  Still, very pretty.  Great colors, love her expression.</td>', 'I think a less centered crop and a bit more sharpness would have made this wonderful.  Still, very pretty.  Great colors, love her expression.', '2008-03-25 21:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586881, 659072, 70514, '<td valign="top">Oh this makes me laugh... my father is a butcher :)  Wonderful processing, great expression, the pose just seals the deal.  Of course I love it.  But my dad does look quite a bit different, and I might add, amazingly enough, more scary!  (it''s true! lol!)</td>', 'Oh this makes me laugh... my father is a butcher :)  Wonderful processing, great expression, the pose just seals the deal.  Of course I love it.  But my dad does look quite a bit different, and I might add, amazingly enough, more scary!  (it''s true! lol!)', '2008-03-25 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586882, 659345, 79021, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  The framing (I assume it''s looking into the basement of a studio) is captivating.  However, I fail to connect the title to the image.  I think I''m missing who the subject is here.  The woman to the right appears to be the main focus but I would classify her more as modeling then an artist.  The woman on the left, however, is an artist but we fail to see her face (or gender really, so I guess saying "the woman on the left" isn''t appropriate).  Challenge aside, looking at the face of the girl, it is very pixelated or noisy.  I''m not sure if it was processed this way or right from the camera, but it does give sort of a "painting" feel, so I guess it works with the image as a whole...4</td>', 'Interesting image.  The framing (I assume it''s looking into the basement of a studio) is captivating.  However, I fail to connect the title to the image.  I think I''m missing who the subject is here.  The woman to the right appears to be the main focus but I would classify her more as modeling then an artist.  The woman on the left, however, is an artist but we fail to see her face (or gender really, so I guess saying "the woman on the left" isn''t appropriate).  Challenge aside, looking at the face of the girl, it is very pixelated or noisy.  I''m not sure if it was processed this way or right from the camera, but it does give sort of a "painting" feel, so I guess it works with the image as a whole...4', '2008-03-25 21:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586887, 658264, 70514, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing in this image.  It almost looks like an overlay. Quite cool, imo.  And not seeing their eyes really adds to the ominious nature of dogs... yikes!</td>', 'I really like the processing in this image.  It almost looks like an overlay. Quite cool, imo.  And not seeing their eyes really adds to the ominious nature of dogs... yikes!', '2008-03-25 21:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586889, 659401, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I like the disconnect between his eyes and the camera, making it feel more like he is in his element rather than posing...5</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I like the disconnect between his eyes and the camera, making it feel more like he is in his element rather than posing...5', '2008-03-25 21:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586893, 659391, 70514, '<td valign="top">I would say this seems so unnatural, but I hate saying, "no pun intended"... but in this case, the light seems harsh, and the bright flourescent (?sp) is (to me at least) quite a distractor.  But I love humor, so bump for that!</td>', 'I would say this seems so unnatural, but I hate saying, "no pun intended"... but in this case, the light seems harsh, and the bright flourescent (?sp) is (to me at least) quite a distractor.  But I love humor, so bump for that!', '2008-03-25 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586895, 658671, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great dof.  I wish the vibrant colors that are so abundant just stood out a bit more.  I''m not sure if it''s the lighting or the contrast.</td>', 'Great dof.  I wish the vibrant colors that are so abundant just stood out a bit more.  I''m not sure if it''s the lighting or the contrast.', '2008-03-25 21:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
