(4586901, 657982, 70514, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack some sharpness and contrast, let alone some emotion.  The cigar isn''t even lit!  Hahhahaha!  I bet he''d sign me.....</td>', 'Seems to lack some sharpness and contrast, let alone some emotion.  The cigar isn''t even lit!  Hahhahaha!  I bet he''d sign me.....', '2008-03-25 21:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586909, 659236, 70514, '<td valign="top">The beautiful light through the window added to the oh so precious softness just makes this perfect, imo.  Wonderful composition as well.  And uh, nice ''gator!  (absolutely beautiful!)</td>', 'The beautiful light through the window added to the oh so precious softness just makes this perfect, imo.  Wonderful composition as well.  And uh, nice ''gator!  (absolutely beautiful!)', '2008-03-25 21:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586915, 659300, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice processing and composition.  Too bad his feet were cut off like that, a bit of a weird junction for me that keeps my eyes distracted</td>', 'Nice processing and composition.  Too bad his feet were cut off like that, a bit of a weird junction for me that keeps my eyes distracted', '2008-03-25 21:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586919, 659171, 70514, '<td valign="top">Oooo... how about the teacher? As Principals are never anyone''s friends, are they?  Anyway, I LOVE the blur and conversion.  So innocent and emotive. Nicely done.</td>', 'Oooo... how about the teacher? As Principals are never anyone''s friends, are they?  Anyway, I LOVE the blur and conversion.  So innocent and emotive. Nicely done.', '2008-03-25 21:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586924, 659236, 79021, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it is a bit soft or if there is just not enough contrast, but something seems to be missing in this shot.  Maybe messing with curves a bit will make the image more striking.  I think a wide angle shot of a baby sleeping where the whole crib is visible may be an interesting shot to try with the proper lighting.  I think it might give more of a sense of how small he/she is, rather than just placing a doll next to him/her.  I don''t have any access to babies, so I can''t try this myself, just something to think about...5</td>', 'I''m not sure if it is a bit soft or if there is just not enough contrast, but something seems to be missing in this shot.  Maybe messing with curves a bit will make the image more striking.  I think a wide angle shot of a baby sleeping where the whole crib is visible may be an interesting shot to try with the proper lighting.  I think it might give more of a sense of how small he/she is, rather than just placing a doll next to him/her.  I don''t have any access to babies, so I can''t try this myself, just something to think about...5', '2008-03-25 21:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586926, 658886, 70514, '<td valign="top">Spectacular, emotive.  Love it.  But must admit to hating such desire in such a young child over something like sport.</td>', 'Spectacular, emotive.  Love it.  But must admit to hating such desire in such a young child over something like sport.', '2008-03-25 21:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586933, 658522, 79021, '<td valign="top">Good positioning, good use of props, and good lighting on the left side of the face (maybe a touch of light on the right side of the face would balance out the skin tones better though).  The pots in the back are a little dull in color, which I think takes away from the image.  More pottery like the one she is holding in the background may add a bit more to the image...5</td>', 'Good positioning, good use of props, and good lighting on the left side of the face (maybe a touch of light on the right side of the face would balance out the skin tones better though).  The pots in the back are a little dull in color, which I think takes away from the image.  More pottery like the one she is holding in the background may add a bit more to the image...5', '2008-03-25 21:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4586942, 659518, 79021, '<td valign="top">This image isn''t very interesting, as it is just a chimp sitting on the ground.  The background is equally not uninteresting.  Also, the Chimp appears slightly out of focus.  The composition is nice, although I think you may have benefitted from another background or a shallower depth of field...4</td>', 'This image isn''t very interesting, as it is just a chimp sitting on the ground.  The background is equally not uninteresting.  Also, the Chimp appears slightly out of focus.  The composition is nice, although I think you may have benefitted from another background or a shallower depth of field...4', '2008-03-25 21:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
