(4587523, 659203, 42013, '<td valign="top">As a scientist, lacks authenticity w/o goggles, but still a nice photo. Do you see the distortion which makes her legs/knees/arm/foreground hand look much too large relative to her head? I can''t decide if my mind is playing tricks with me. Could happen though when using the 18-55 in a tight space... Maybe it was intentional?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-26 02:43:01.</i></td>', 'As a scientist, lacks authenticity w/o goggles, but still a nice photo. Do you see the distortion which makes her legs/knees/arm/foreground hand look much too large relative to her head? I can''t decide if my mind is playing tricks with me. Could happen though when using the 18-55 in a tight space... Maybe it was intentional?', '2008-03-26 02:25:06.000000', '2008-03-26 02:43:01.000000', 0),
(4587527, 659203, 70000, '<td valign="top">I feel that your concept would have been more effective if she actually was paying attention to what chemicals she is mixing. It is her facial expression and body language that makes her not look like a scientist I think, not really her dress. Also the lighting is a bit harsh it seems to me.</td>', 'I feel that your concept would have been more effective if she actually was paying attention to what chemicals she is mixing. It is her facial expression and body language that makes her not look like a scientist I think, not really her dress. Also the lighting is a bit harsh it seems to me.', '2008-03-26 02:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
