(4587787, 659662, 43519, '<td valign="top">I found this shot very attractive, and much more appealing to me than the blue ribbon of this challenge. Sometimes, I wondered about the votes!<br/> <br/>In any events, it is a simple shot, very well framed, wonderful dof (thanks the for the fantastic Nikon 17-55mm lens!), the action is well taken and the atmosphere feels real! That would be a fantastic journalistic photograph.<br/> <br/>This picture deserved to be in the top 3</td>', 'I found this shot very attractive, and much more appealing to me than the blue ribbon of this challenge. Sometimes, I wondered about the votes! In any events, it is a simple shot, very well framed, wonderful dof (thanks the for the fantastic Nikon 17-55mm lens!), the action is well taken and the atmosphere feels real! That would be a fantastic journalistic photograph. This picture deserved to be in the top 3', '2008-03-26 07:12:40.000000', NULL, 0),
