(4599187, 659662, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg"/></a> a lovely image, the forced perspective, the angles of his arms, the colours and textures, all just wonderful. plus, i love tanzania, and dimly remember driving through morogoro (we did 15,000k in a small car in 5 weeks...)</td>', ' a lovely image, the forced perspective, the angles of his arms, the colours and textures, all just wonderful. plus, i love tanzania, and dimly remember driving through morogoro (we did 15,000k in a small car in 5 weeks...)', '2008-03-31 14:39:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4599189, 657866, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> the night, red and black, the dirt and grime, arresting, voting, important stuff happening here.   a lovely, deep and dark image.</td>', ' the night, red and black, the dirt and grime, arresting, voting, important stuff happening here.   a lovely, deep and dark image.', '2008-03-31 14:40:27.000000', NULL, 0),
